(172918, 9753, 1280, '<td valign="top">Oh how beautiful!  North country...I miss it.  This looks like the Adirondacks. You did a wonderful job of capturing the magic. The only thing I''d do differently is to have the clearing (stream bed?) off center, on a diagonal I think....just a personal preference. It''s a beauty!</td>', 'Oh how beautiful!  North country...I miss it.  This looks like the Adirondacks. You did a wonderful job of capturing the magic. The only thing I''d do differently is to have the clearing (stream bed?) off center, on a diagonal I think....just a personal preference. It''s a beauty!', '2002-12-16 00:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(172921, 9614, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed and focused.</td>', 'Nicely exposed and focused.', '2002-12-16 00:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
