(172959, 9757, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice colors! It looks like the lower left portion of the bird is slighty blurred which takes away from the shot. The background looks great though. Not bad.</td>', 'Nice colors! It looks like the lower left portion of the bird is slighty blurred which takes away from the shot. The background looks great though. Not bad.', '2002-12-16 01:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
