(172971, 9783, 4625, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I really enjoy the size and cropping. The color is fabulous. Well done.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I really enjoy the size and cropping. The color is fabulous. Well done.', '2002-12-16 01:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
