(172976, 9729, 4625, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. The lighting looks a little poor. The cropping is nice, the border is fitting, and the layout looks good.</td>', 'Interesting effect. The lighting looks a little poor. The cropping is nice, the border is fitting, and the layout looks good.', '2002-12-16 01:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(172978, 9819, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely georgeous.  The power it emits from the rushing stream.  The way the water has pulled everything across the rock on the left bottom corner adds so much to the whole photo.  I personally don''t see how you could have improved it one bit.  Fantistic job.  Great composition with execellent execution.</td>', 'This is absolutely georgeous.  The power it emits from the rushing stream.  The way the water has pulled everything across the rock on the left bottom corner adds so much to the whole photo.  I personally don''t see how you could have improved it one bit.  Fantistic job.  Great composition with execellent execution.', '2002-12-16 01:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(172979, 9755, 4625, '<td valign="top">The white background feels really unnatural in this shot. I think a more natural background would be more appealing.</td>', 'The white background feels really unnatural in this shot. I think a more natural background would be more appealing.', '2002-12-16 01:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(172981, 9636, 4625, '<td valign="top">Ooo I like this shot. Really neat! Love the way it\''s layed out. Love the sepia tone... The thin border works great. Well done.</td>', 'Ooo I like this shot. Really neat! Love the way it\''s layed out. Love the sepia tone... The thin border works great. Well done.', '2002-12-16 01:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(172982, 9819, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice clean looking shot. Very crisp. I like the green in the corner without it this shot wouldn''t be nearly as appealing. Well done.</td>', 'Nice clean looking shot. Very crisp. I like the green in the corner without it this shot wouldn''t be nearly as appealing. Well done.', '2002-12-16 01:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(172983, 9677, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice sky shot. Caught those clouds at the perfect time! they frame the moon wonderfully... and the sections of blue behind the clouds works great. Well done.</td>', 'Nice sky shot. Caught those clouds at the perfect time! they frame the moon wonderfully... and the sections of blue behind the clouds works great. Well done.', '2002-12-16 01:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(172984, 9630, 3080, '<td valign="top">the kid is cute, but the challenge says to create a photo that involves NO human intervention.  this photo is nothing but human intervention.  sorry</td>', 'the kid is cute, but the challenge says to create a photo that involves NO human intervention.  this photo is nothing but human intervention.  sorry', '2002-12-16 01:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(172985, 9644, 4625, '<td valign="top">The blacks are very black and it looks good. I like the curves in this shot, the way the antlers are set up works great. Well done.</td>', 'The blacks are very black and it looks good. I like the curves in this shot, the way the antlers are set up works great. Well done.', '2002-12-16 01:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
