(172987, 9649, 4625, '<td valign="top">Wow, that almost look slike something out of a scifi flik... The only problem with the picture is the quality. The Jpeg seems too compressed, or the camera just didn''t capture it quite right...</td>', 'Wow, that almost look slike something out of a scifi flik... The only problem with the picture is the quality. The Jpeg seems too compressed, or the camera just didn''t capture it quite right...', '2002-12-16 01:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
