(172992, 9790, 4625, '<td valign="top">Just no point of interest in this shot. It''s very grey as well... no great texture... Nothing in this shot seems to be clear...</td>', 'Just no point of interest in this shot. It''s very grey as well... no great texture... Nothing in this shot seems to be clear...', '2002-12-16 01:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
