(173016, 9824, 4510, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge beautifully, nice shot.</td>', 'Fits the challenge beautifully, nice shot.', '2002-12-16 01:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(173018, 9820, 4625, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty good, but I think I''d like to have seen less blur in the foreground. That water looks like it should be crystal clear, but the motion blur or focal point seems to take away from it a lot. Otherwise the shot looks good. the lighting seems nice, and feels comforting somehow. Overall not bad.</td>', 'Looks pretty good, but I think I''d like to have seen less blur in the foreground. That water looks like it should be crystal clear, but the motion blur or focal point seems to take away from it a lot. Otherwise the shot looks good. the lighting seems nice, and feels comforting somehow. Overall not bad.', '2002-12-16 01:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(173019, 9676, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great shot I really like it.</td>', 'Great shot I really like it.', '2002-12-16 01:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(173021, 9608, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF in this shot, but the subject itself is a little uninteresting to me. the shot is very clean, the lighting is nice, and it looks good though. Well done.</td>', 'I like the DOF in this shot, but the subject itself is a little uninteresting to me. the shot is very clean, the lighting is nice, and it looks good though. Well done.', '2002-12-16 01:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(173022, 9759, 4510, '<td valign="top">Well composed, nice light and colour.</td>', 'Well composed, nice light and colour.', '2002-12-16 01:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(173023, 9676, 4625, '<td valign="top">the harsh contrast between the steamy area and the clear area doesn''t look too great in my opinion. The colors in the forground are nice, but contrast too much with the softer fogged over colors in the back. a Lower crop might have helped reduce that contrasting feel in this shot.</td>', 'the harsh contrast between the steamy area and the clear area doesn''t look too great in my opinion. The colors in the forground are nice, but contrast too much with the softer fogged over colors in the back. a Lower crop might have helped reduce that contrasting feel in this shot.', '2002-12-16 01:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(173025, 9722, 4625, '<td valign="top">The green mossy looking area on the rock in the dead center seems to be the focus of this picture, but my eye isn''t drawn to that at all. Instead I find myself looking at the slightly fuzzy background. if the background were blurred more I think it would have turned out better.</td>', 'The green mossy looking area on the rock in the dead center seems to be the focus of this picture, but my eye isn''t drawn to that at all. Instead I find myself looking at the slightly fuzzy background. if the background were blurred more I think it would have turned out better.', '2002-12-16 02:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(173026, 9714, 4510, '<td valign="top">Good composition, for me it needed the rocks to be in focus.</td>', 'Good composition, for me it needed the rocks to be in focus.', '2002-12-16 02:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(173027, 9700, 4625, '<td valign="top">This shot feels a little chaotic to me... there''s pine needles going everywhere. If the shot focused more on the pinecone and berries around it I think it would have flowed a little better. Also eliminating the twig infront of the pinecone would have helped.</td>', 'This shot feels a little chaotic to me... there''s pine needles going everywhere. If the shot focused more on the pinecone and berries around it I think it would have flowed a little better. Also eliminating the twig infront of the pinecone would have helped.', '2002-12-16 02:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(173028, 9680, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2002-12-16 02:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
