(173033, 9684, 4625, '<td valign="top">The lighting isn''t the best here. The nest is awfully dark in comparison to the well lit background. I like the placement of the nest in the shot, and the cropping and sizing is done well.</td>', 'The lighting isn''t the best here. The nest is awfully dark in comparison to the well lit background. I like the placement of the nest in the shot, and the cropping and sizing is done well.', '2002-12-16 02:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
