(173120, 9729, 2337, '<td valign="top">I expect you''re going to have a rough week.  This species of animal would never have existed if mankind hadn''t cultivated it.  This is, however, a <i>wonderful</i> shot, and I for one, don''t plan to mark you down on the technicality... Great shot!</td>', 'I expect you''re going to have a rough week.  This species of animal would never have existed if mankind hadn''t cultivated it.  This is, however, a wonderful shot, and I for one, don''t plan to mark you down on the technicality... Great shot!', '2002-12-16 04:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(173121, 9630, 2337, '<td valign="top">As wonderful as this image is and as much as i agree that children are truely heaven sent, this really doesn''t meet the challenge very well :(  Expect to hear that a lot this week, but don''t be discourged... It''s a wonderful shot, just not really on topic.</td>', 'As wonderful as this image is and as much as i agree that children are truely heaven sent, this really doesn''t meet the challenge very well :(  Expect to hear that a lot this week, but don''t be discourged... It''s a wonderful shot, just not really on topic.', '2002-12-16 04:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
