(173131, 9729, 2553, '<td valign="top">Like this shot a lot.  Nice composition, love that you decided on the reflection instead of just taking a straight on shot of the beast.  Has a very nice "painterly" feel to it.  9</td>', 'Like this shot a lot.  Nice composition, love that you decided on the reflection instead of just taking a straight on shot of the beast.  Has a very nice "painterly" feel to it.  9', '2002-12-16 05:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(173132, 9784, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though this shot doesn''t have a lot of "emotional" appeal to me, I do like the shot, and especially like the black and white.  Don''t think I would have liked it much in color, it wouldn''t have the same stark, artsy feel to it.  9</td>', 'Though this shot doesn''t have a lot of "emotional" appeal to me, I do like the shot, and especially like the black and white.  Don''t think I would have liked it much in color, it wouldn''t have the same stark, artsy feel to it.  9', '2002-12-16 05:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(173133, 9684, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, and the way you have it framed,  but the shot isn''t real high impact for me.  8</td>', 'I like the subject, and the way you have it framed,  but the shot isn''t real high impact for me.  8', '2002-12-16 05:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(173135, 9649, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, and the color of the shot.  The composition feels a little "off" for me, feels like there is a little too much sky.  The flower does not appear crisp and sharp, and allowing for the possibility that you intended it this way, or that it was unavoidable, (or that it''s my monitor!), I think I would have preferred to see a bit more of a sharper focus on the flower.  8</td>', 'I like the subject, and the color of the shot.  The composition feels a little "off" for me, feels like there is a little too much sky.  The flower does not appear crisp and sharp, and allowing for the possibility that you intended it this way, or that it was unavoidable, (or that it''s my monitor!), I think I would have preferred to see a bit more of a sharper focus on the flower.  8', '2002-12-16 05:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(173136, 9636, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like your subject, your color, and the composition you chose.  Though not extrememly high impact for me, I still like the shot a lot.  8</td>', 'I like your subject, your color, and the composition you chose.  Though not extrememly high impact for me, I still like the shot a lot.  8', '2002-12-16 05:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(173137, 9614, 2553, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, one of my favorite subjects.  Overall, I like the shot, but don''t care for the extremely tight crop, it makes the shot feel a bit crowded to me, I would have liked to see a little "breathing room".  I do realize that this may have been unavoidable, and otherwise, l like it.  8</td>', 'Sweet shot, one of my favorite subjects.  Overall, I like the shot, but don''t care for the extremely tight crop, it makes the shot feel a bit crowded to me, I would have liked to see a little "breathing room".  I do realize that this may have been unavoidable, and otherwise, l like it.  8', '2002-12-16 05:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(173139, 9789, 2553, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and color.  Composition works pretty well for me, but the shot is not high impact for me emotionally.  8</td>', 'Interesting subject and color.  Composition works pretty well for me, but the shot is not high impact for me emotionally.  8', '2002-12-16 05:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(173140, 9746, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice cloudscape.  Good variation of light and dark, and the composition that you chose appeals to me. 8</td>', 'Nice cloudscape.  Good variation of light and dark, and the composition that you chose appeals to me. 8', '2002-12-16 05:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(173142, 9781, 2553, '<td valign="top">I just love icicles, and this is a very nice shot.  Love the black and white, and the nice dark background.  The crop on the shot feels slightly unbalanced to me though I can''t put my finger on why, exactly.  8</td>', 'I just love icicles, and this is a very nice shot.  Love the black and white, and the nice dark background.  The crop on the shot feels slightly unbalanced to me though I can''t put my finger on why, exactly.  8', '2002-12-16 05:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(173145, 9740, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the look of stark branches against the sky, and you have captured a nice variation of light and dark in the sky; the pattern of the brances is nice, but the composition isn''t high impact for me.  8</td>', 'I love the look of stark branches against the sky, and you have captured a nice variation of light and dark in the sky; the pattern of the brances is nice, but the composition isn''t high impact for me.  8', '2002-12-16 05:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(173146, 9772, 2553, '<td valign="top">I think your DOF works well in this shot.  I like that there is a good clear view of the tree, the fungus, and the strange purple leaf, and the soft diffuse background has a nice feel to it.  Beautiful "nature-y" shot.  8</td>', 'I think your DOF works well in this shot.  I like that there is a good clear view of the tree, the fungus, and the strange purple leaf, and the soft diffuse background has a nice feel to it.  Beautiful "nature-y" shot.  8', '2002-12-16 05:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
