(173285, 9774, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>composition -- nicely composed using ROT.  <br/>technical -- good even lighting.  good focus.<br/>overall impression -- the background isn''t very exciting to me, therefore i would''ve tried to crop closer to the main subject, the animal.  maybe a portrait format that keeps the little bits of green in the top right corner in the photo.</td>', 'challenge -- metcomposition -- nicely composed using ROT.  technical -- good even lighting.  good focus.overall impression -- the background isn''t very exciting to me, therefore i would''ve tried to crop closer to the main subject, the animal.  maybe a portrait format that keeps the little bits of green in the top right corner in the photo.', '2002-12-16 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(173289, 9759, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>composition -- i like how the tree trunk runs diagonally through the photo.<br/>technical -- lighting is pretty good, just a couple of hotspots from the sun, but nothing too distracting.  nice sharp focus on the main subject<br/>impression -- i would like to see the background (especially at the top right) a little more blurred.   those needles are just a bit busy for my liking.</td>', 'challenge -- metcomposition -- i like how the tree trunk runs diagonally through the photo.technical -- lighting is pretty good, just a couple of hotspots from the sun, but nothing too distracting.  nice sharp focus on the main subjectimpression -- i would like to see the background (especially at the top right) a little more blurred.   those needles are just a bit busy for my liking.', '2002-12-16 11:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(173293, 9790, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>composition -- i like how you closely cropped in on the subject<br/>technical -- hard to see what i''m looking at because there''s not much tonal/color range and no easily distinguishable borders<br/>overall impression -- this one actually works better in the thumbnail.  i''m intrigued by the photo a lot and hope you put some more descriptions with it that i can read on monday.  however, as a photo, i wish it was a little more obvious what i''m looking at.  i have no idea if that was possible or not.</td>', 'challenge -- metcomposition -- i like how you closely cropped in on the subjecttechnical -- hard to see what i''m looking at because there''s not much tonal/color range and no easily distinguishable bordersoverall impression -- this one actually works better in the thumbnail.  i''m intrigued by the photo a lot and hope you put some more descriptions with it that i can read on monday.  however, as a photo, i wish it was a little more obvious what i''m looking at.  i have no idea if that was possible or not.', '2002-12-16 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(173305, 9790, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great eye to even notice the frog, nice shot, fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Great eye to even notice the frog, nice shot, fits the challenge well.', '2002-12-16 11:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(173308, 9781, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>composition -- the long format really works well here, so does b&amp;w.  nice title, too.<br/>technical -- somehow this doesn''t look as crisp and clear to me as i would expect, but i am at a loss whether that''s the photo or post-processing.  sorry.<br/>overall impression -- love the idea and composition, not so sure about the technical aspects of it all.</td>', 'challenge -- metcomposition -- the long format really works well here, so does b&w.  nice title, too.technical -- somehow this doesn''t look as crisp and clear to me as i would expect, but i am at a loss whether that''s the photo or post-processing.  sorry.overall impression -- love the idea and composition, not so sure about the technical aspects of it all.', '2002-12-16 11:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(173309, 9815, 4510, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, the reflection does it for me.</td>', 'I really like this shot, the reflection does it for me.', '2002-12-16 11:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(173317, 9714, 573, '<td valign="top">I have tryed several times to display this picture wothout success.  I will try again later in the week.</td>', 'I have tryed several times to display this picture wothout success.  I will try again later in the week.', '2002-12-16 12:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(173320, 9684, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>composition -- good positioning of the nest in the frame.  i like that branch to the left that seems to be coming out at the viewer and gives the photo a good feeling of depth.<br/>technical --  just a few blown out hightlights where the sunlight hit the surrounding branches, but not too distracting.  nice focus and sharpness.<br/>overall impression -- good photo of a not overwhelmingly interesting (to me) subject.</td>', 'challenge -- metcomposition -- good positioning of the nest in the frame.  i like that branch to the left that seems to be coming out at the viewer and gives the photo a good feeling of depth.technical --  just a few blown out hightlights where the sunlight hit the surrounding branches, but not too distracting.  nice focus and sharpness.overall impression -- good photo of a not overwhelmingly interesting (to me) subject.', '2002-12-16 12:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(173322, 9772, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>composition -- i like how the tree is a bit off-centered and then offset by that large purple leaf.<br/>technical -- focus is nice, but the whole photo is a little, well, grainy is not the right word, but shows signs of oversharpening, especially in the background.<br/>overall impression -- isolated the tree and leaf fairly well in what looks like a busy and crowded environment.  some post-processing issues.</td>', 'challenge -- metcomposition -- i like how the tree is a bit off-centered and then offset by that large purple leaf.technical -- focus is nice, but the whole photo is a little, well, grainy is not the right word, but shows signs of oversharpening, especially in the background.overall impression -- isolated the tree and leaf fairly well in what looks like a busy and crowded environment.  some post-processing issues.', '2002-12-16 12:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(173324, 9746, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>composition -- good<br/>technical -- nice range between light and dark, w/out blowouts or loosing detail.<br/>overall impression -- i like clouds, and i appreciate the variety in this photo.</td>', 'challenge -- metcomposition -- goodtechnical -- nice range between light and dark, w/out blowouts or loosing detail.overall impression -- i like clouds, and i appreciate the variety in this photo.', '2002-12-16 12:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(173327, 9824, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  nice find for the challenge.  i like the placement of the tree in the overall frame, and the woodchips on the ground.  the thing i like the least is the bland sky.  i know you can''t control that, but i wonder what this photo would look like cropped into a square (taking the sky off and maybe just a tad off the bottom, too). format.</td>', 'challenge met.  nice find for the challenge.  i like the placement of the tree in the overall frame, and the woodchips on the ground.  the thing i like the least is the bland sky.  i know you can''t control that, but i wonder what this photo would look like cropped into a square (taking the sky off and maybe just a tad off the bottom, too). format.', '2002-12-16 12:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(173329, 9696, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  you have picked a nice combination of busy twigs and also some empty space to frame the bird, i like that.  also like that you have a nicely colored sky and that you caught the bird looking to the side.  i don''t like the processing you did to the photo so much, there''s a slight "halo" around everything that suggests to me that maybe you sharpened the image just a tad too much.</td>', 'challenge met.  you have picked a nice combination of busy twigs and also some empty space to frame the bird, i like that.  also like that you have a nicely colored sky and that you caught the bird looking to the side.  i don''t like the processing you did to the photo so much, there''s a slight "halo" around everything that suggests to me that maybe you sharpened the image just a tad too much.', '2002-12-16 12:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(173344, 9821, 3102, '<td valign="top">One could argue that the jet contrails in the sky would be "the hand of man."  Aren''t we an anal retentive bunch?  :)</td>', 'One could argue that the jet contrails in the sky would be "the hand of man."  Aren''t we an anal retentive bunch?  :)', '2002-12-16 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(173347, 9729, 4805, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I like the reflections. As for being hand of man...this a wild steer is it?</td>', 'This is a great photo. I like the reflections. As for being hand of man...this a wild steer is it?', '2002-12-16 13:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(173348, 9630, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m sure she is... but you''re clearly bypassing the intention of the challenge...</td>', 'I''m sure she is... but you''re clearly bypassing the intention of the challenge...', '2002-12-16 13:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(173351, 9729, 3102, '<td valign="top">Reflection in a pond...?  Well done!</td>', 'Reflection in a pond...?  Well done!', '2002-12-16 13:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(173352, 9630, 4805, '<td valign="top">Ummm...yeah...this made by man. Two chicks and a turkey baster counts, too.</td>', 'Ummm...yeah...this made by man. Two chicks and a turkey baster counts, too.', '2002-12-16 13:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(173353, 9644, 4805, '<td valign="top">This was assembled by human hands...</td>', 'This was assembled by human hands...', '2002-12-16 13:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(173354, 9661, 4805, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but created with human hands.</td>', 'Great photo, but created with human hands.', '2002-12-16 13:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(173363, 9714, 327, '<td valign="top">? what is the flash on the upper right side? Was this a framed photo? I''m lost on this. It''s beautiful that I know.</td>', '? what is the flash on the upper right side? Was this a framed photo? I''m lost on this. It''s beautiful that I know.', '2002-12-16 13:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(173364, 9757, 327, '<td valign="top">We have these at our zoo. They are very neat birds and really great colors. They bite too!! Nice shot, but could do without the lower right. I realized you''d of lost the bird if you took it out. Nice focus.</td>', 'We have these at our zoo. They are very neat birds and really great colors. They bite too!! Nice shot, but could do without the lower right. I realized you''d of lost the bird if you took it out. Nice focus.', '2002-12-16 13:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(173365, 9789, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  nice composition, it looks as if the fruit (?) is holding up the leaf above it.  the long shadows work well here because i always associate cacti with hot climates and expect the sun to be beating down.  i wonder what made you go for the sepia tones.  possibly the colors in the background.  w/out actually seeing it i can''t say i''d prefer color, but i''m wondering whether i would...</td>', 'challenge met.  nice composition, it looks as if the fruit (?) is holding up the leaf above it.  the long shadows work well here because i always associate cacti with hot climates and expect the sun to be beating down.  i wonder what made you go for the sepia tones.  possibly the colors in the background.  w/out actually seeing it i can''t say i''d prefer color, but i''m wondering whether i would...', '2002-12-16 13:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(173367, 9722, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty rocks and water. Would of worked in the motion challenge also. I think the bottom could of been cropped off by 3/4 and the levels bumped up a bit. Nice shot.</td>', 'Pretty rocks and water. Would of worked in the motion challenge also. I think the bottom could of been cropped off by 3/4 and the levels bumped up a bit. Nice shot.', '2002-12-16 13:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(173369, 9793, 327, '<td valign="top">Pixels..compression?  I do like the shot, but most unusual.</td>', 'Pixels..compression?  I do like the shot, but most unusual.', '2002-12-16 13:34:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(173370, 9730, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat capture of a ?wood duck?....Cool. Love the blue.</td>', 'Neat capture of a ?wood duck?....Cool. Love the blue.', '2002-12-16 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(173371, 9757, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  lovely colors of the bird.  great focus, too, and the catchlight in the eye is an added bonus.  i don''t like the background as much, personally.  while it is sufficiently out of focus to not contain any distracting objects, it does have a lot of tonal differences from the light through the vegetation.  the one to the left of the wing and just above the branch are most distracting, for outside of DPC you can probably tone them down a bit and therefore make this an even better shot.</td>', 'challenge met.  lovely colors of the bird.  great focus, too, and the catchlight in the eye is an added bonus.  i don''t like the background as much, personally.  while it is sufficiently out of focus to not contain any distracting objects, it does have a lot of tonal differences from the light through the vegetation.  the one to the left of the wing and just above the branch are most distracting, for outside of DPC you can probably tone them down a bit and therefore make this an even better shot.', '2002-12-16 13:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(173372, 9630, 327, '<td valign="top">Darling shot but just too dark. This of course could easily be corrected. He is so healthy and happy looking. Great capture. Geeezzz if my teeth were 1/5 that white!!!!</td>', 'Darling shot but just too dark. This of course could easily be corrected. He is so healthy and happy looking. Great capture. Geeezzz if my teeth were 1/5 that white!!!!', '2002-12-16 13:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(173374, 9703, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition here but the top is cropped too tight, wish the camera was elevated about three feet. Still I do love this, it''s nice work.</td>', 'Good composition here but the top is cropped too tight, wish the camera was elevated about three feet. Still I do love this, it''s nice work.', '2002-12-16 13:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(173375, 9614, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love his winter coat. I like the composition and love the b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice shot. Love his winter coat. I like the composition and love the b&w.', '2002-12-16 13:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(173378, 9821, 327, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the reflection....was that the car, plane window? I do like the composition. Nice focus.</td>', 'Too bad about the reflection....was that the car, plane window? I do like the composition. Nice focus.', '2002-12-16 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(173379, 9730, 1041, '<td valign="top">LOL ... i was sitting here staring at your photo, trying to figure out that faint line that''s running through it ... and finally noticed it''s a line on my monitor, not your photo.  your score just went up a point!  ;)<br/>anyway.  challenge met.  i like how there''s just a little bit of detail still visible in the bird, where it''s placed, and how it is surrounded by the mainly bare branches with just a few leaves left.  the twisted neck on the bird is a bonus because it makes the sillhouette even more interesting.  the frame works well, too, but is a little too wide for my personal taste.  i really like this shot though.  :)</td>', 'LOL ... i was sitting here staring at your photo, trying to figure out that faint line that''s running through it ... and finally noticed it''s a line on my monitor, not your photo.  your score just went up a point!  ;)anyway.  challenge met.  i like how there''s just a little bit of detail still visible in the bird, where it''s placed, and how it is surrounded by the mainly bare branches with just a few leaves left.  the twisted neck on the bird is a bonus because it makes the sillhouette even more interesting.  the frame works well, too, but is a little too wide for my personal taste.  i really like this shot though.  :)', '2002-12-16 13:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(173380, 9721, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice color, nice focus.</td>', 'Nice color, nice focus.', '2002-12-16 13:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(173381, 9748, 327, '<td valign="top">Moody shot, I like it.</td>', 'Moody shot, I like it.', '2002-12-16 13:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(173382, 9680, 327, '<td valign="top">Burrrrrh, good red and green. Holiday feeling.</td>', 'Burrrrrh, good red and green. Holiday feeling.', '2002-12-16 13:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(173384, 9768, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  wonderful colors in the sky, i like how they intensify just where the palmtree sillhouettes are.  i would like to see more of the trees, but i suspect you''d see the "hand of man" somewhere if you included more at the bottom .... good use of negative space.</td>', 'challenge met.  wonderful colors in the sky, i like how they intensify just where the palmtree sillhouettes are.  i would like to see more of the trees, but i suspect you''d see the "hand of man" somewhere if you included more at the bottom .... good use of negative space.', '2002-12-16 13:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(173385, 9761, 327, '<td valign="top">What great expressions....all the kids. lol. Nice shot.</td>', 'What great expressions....all the kids. lol. Nice shot.', '2002-12-16 13:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(173386, 9777, 327, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, color. Nice work.</td>', 'Very good composition, color. Nice work.', '2002-12-16 13:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(173389, 9783, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely, great color.<br/>The compostion could of been moved off center a bit and cropped out the far right.</td>', 'Lovely, great color.The compostion could of been moved off center a bit and cropped out the far right.', '2002-12-16 13:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(173390, 9608, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, nice color, nice work.</td>', 'Nice focus, nice color, nice work.', '2002-12-16 13:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
