(173416, 9784, 327, '<td valign="top">Love this shot......lots of movement here, lots to see and nothing at all!!! Fantastic eye. Good job.</td>', 'Love this shot......lots of movement here, lots to see and nothing at all!!! Fantastic eye. Good job.', '2002-12-16 13:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(173417, 9758, 3080, '<td valign="top">While it was created inside the camera, I simply don''t like it.  Each little TINY picture is too small to get any detail from at all.  I can''t tell if that''s a nest, or a dead flower/plant.  I really have no interest in seeing 9 of basically the same image. The image its self is just too small.  Sorry.</td>', 'While it was created inside the camera, I simply don''t like it.  Each little TINY picture is too small to get any detail from at all.  I can''t tell if that''s a nest, or a dead flower/plant.  I really have no interest in seeing 9 of basically the same image. The image its self is just too small.  Sorry.', '2002-12-16 13:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(173418, 9789, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the color. Good composition, color.</td>', 'Very nice, love the color. Good composition, color.', '2002-12-16 13:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(173419, 9713, 327, '<td valign="top">WOW and then some......really good color, impact. Fine work.</td>', 'WOW and then some......really good color, impact. Fine work.', '2002-12-16 13:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(173420, 9815, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, love the composition, and the focus. Good b&amp;w.</td>', 'Pretty shot, love the composition, and the focus. Good b&w.', '2002-12-16 13:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(173421, 9627, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work, love the color.</td>', 'Nice work, love the color.', '2002-12-16 13:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(173422, 9707, 327, '<td valign="top">Like the color at the bottom very much. Not crazy for the light, little dark and the focus is too soft for me. Also the tree is dead center, still this color is very good and I like that very much.</td>', 'Like the color at the bottom very much. Not crazy for the light, little dark and the focus is too soft for me. Also the tree is dead center, still this color is very good and I like that very much.', '2002-12-16 13:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(173423, 9661, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat, fantastic movement and colors......love it.</td>', 'Neat, fantastic movement and colors......love it.', '2002-12-16 13:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(173424, 9755, 327, '<td valign="top">Love this....it''s very stark....love that look. NICE work...really nice.</td>', 'Love this....it''s very stark....love that look. NICE work...really nice.', '2002-12-16 14:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(173427, 9810, 327, '<td valign="top">Strange rock formation..Interesting. Is that iron the red? Cool shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Strange rock formation..Interesting. Is that iron the red? Cool shot. Nice work.', '2002-12-16 14:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(173430, 9649, 327, '<td valign="top">Good work, good eye, great colors. WOW. Not crazy for the focus here, but sure a nice shot.</td>', 'Good work, good eye, great colors. WOW. Not crazy for the focus here, but sure a nice shot.', '2002-12-16 14:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(173432, 9744, 327, '<td valign="top">Really like the composition, color, focus.....love the whole shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Really like the composition, color, focus.....love the whole shot. Nice work.', '2002-12-16 14:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(173434, 9661, 1005, '<td valign="top">While I really like the color and motion of this shot, I am having a hard time believing this "just occurred" like this.  You created a brilliant image, with your human hands.  If this met the challenge, it would be an easy 9 or 10, but the challenge comes first.  Sorry, but 6.  Swash  (If this really occurred "naturally", I will consider changing your score.)  Oh, it''s too pretty for 6, O.K. 7, but that''s it.</td>', 'While I really like the color and motion of this shot, I am having a hard time believing this "just occurred" like this.  You created a brilliant image, with your human hands.  If this met the challenge, it would be an easy 9 or 10, but the challenge comes first.  Sorry, but 6.  Swash  (If this really occurred "naturally", I will consider changing your score.)  Oh, it''s too pretty for 6, O.K. 7, but that''s it.', '2002-12-16 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(173437, 9630, 1005, '<td valign="top">I suspect you may have had a hand getting this little one started.  It''s a cute photo, but IMO, not the challenge.  It''s a very cute and appealling photo, but I have to mark you down for the challenge.  Sorry.  6 Swash</td>', 'I suspect you may have had a hand getting this little one started.  It''s a cute photo, but IMO, not the challenge.  It''s a very cute and appealling photo, but I have to mark you down for the challenge.  Sorry.  6 Swash', '2002-12-16 14:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(173441, 9761, 1005, '<td valign="top">There''s the hand of man right there!  (santa''s)  I must really be missing something here, the connection to the challenge!  Nice photo, wrong challenge.  6 Swash</td>', 'There''s the hand of man right there!  (santa''s)  I must really be missing something here, the connection to the challenge!  Nice photo, wrong challenge.  6 Swash', '2002-12-16 14:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(173443, 9729, 1005, '<td valign="top">Technically, cows are bred by men, but that''s really pushing nit.  Very interesting shot!  I wouldn''t have DQ''d it, but prolly a good thing to have the admin comment.  10 Swash</td>', 'Technically, cows are bred by men, but that''s really pushing nit.  Very interesting shot!  I wouldn''t have DQ''d it, but prolly a good thing to have the admin comment.  10 Swash', '2002-12-16 14:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(173447, 9757, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a loorakeet!  Except for the flash on the beak, this is a wonderful, colorful shot.  The branch in the lower right corner is a tad distracting, but still, this is a 10 in my book!  Congrats!  Swash</td>', 'Great shot of a loorakeet!  Except for the flash on the beak, this is a wonderful, colorful shot.  The branch in the lower right corner is a tad distracting, but still, this is a 10 in my book!  Congrats!  Swash', '2002-12-16 14:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(173474, 9761, 5082, '<td valign="top">I like the expressions of the children, but I don''t see how it relates to te theme of the competition.</td>', 'I like the expressions of the children, but I don''t see how it relates to te theme of the competition.', '2002-12-16 15:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(173475, 9636, 5082, '<td valign="top">Very compelling shot, almost looks duo-toned or sepia.</td>', 'Very compelling shot, almost looks duo-toned or sepia.', '2002-12-16 15:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(173477, 9663, 3732, '<td valign="top">Nice!!</td>', 'Nice!!', '2002-12-16 15:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(173478, 9661, 4967, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  I think I''m a little more liberal minded then some and you''ll prolly get a lot of, "how does this fit the challenge?"  but I think it fits well.  Just as G-d created nature, he also had to put in color, and I think it''s an excellent interpretation of the challenge!  Nice job!  The only thing I would say is that it doesn''t look like a photo, more like a piece of art, so I''m hoping it is your art.  Great composition, I love how it comes out of the upper left corner.  Love the white space, and overall I think this is a beautiful piece of sork.  I''m taking a point off for it being more a photo of art then a photo that is art.  But still a solid 9 in my eyes!  Great job!  Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent photo.  I think I''m a little more liberal minded then some and you''ll prolly get a lot of, "how does this fit the challenge?"  but I think it fits well.  Just as G-d created nature, he also had to put in color, and I think it''s an excellent interpretation of the challenge!  Nice job!  The only thing I would say is that it doesn''t look like a photo, more like a piece of art, so I''m hoping it is your art.  Great composition, I love how it comes out of the upper left corner.  Love the white space, and overall I think this is a beautiful piece of sork.  I''m taking a point off for it being more a photo of art then a photo that is art.  But still a solid 9 in my eyes!  Great job!  Good luck.', '2002-12-16 15:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(173479, 9649, 5082, '<td valign="top">Great composition, like the blue cast to the photo, there seems to be a distractingly high level of noise in the photo.  I would be interested in what Neat Image or like progs could do to remove it.</td>', 'Great composition, like the blue cast to the photo, there seems to be a distractingly high level of noise in the photo.  I would be interested in what Neat Image or like progs could do to remove it.', '2002-12-16 15:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(173503, 9614, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty horse, also a nice capture of it.  Technically this is a great photo except for the line coming out of the top left of the head.  I also think the picture is maybe a tad light, but thats tough because it''s a white horse with black on it.  The left side of the body looks a little burnt out, maybe a tad bit too much light there.  Now in terms of the challenge, I personally see what you were going for, but I don''t think it worked.  This is obviously a domestic animal that has been well cared for.  It doesn''t have any visible whiskers which means it was shaved, and the mane and forelock are shorn pretty short, and the ears are well trimmed.  This had to have been done by the hand of man (or woman) and so it does not fit the challenge.  I''m giving you a 5 for a beautiful picture, but one that does not seem to fit the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very pretty horse, also a nice capture of it.  Technically this is a great photo except for the line coming out of the top left of the head.  I also think the picture is maybe a tad light, but thats tough because it''s a white horse with black on it.  The left side of the body looks a little burnt out, maybe a tad bit too much light there.  Now in terms of the challenge, I personally see what you were going for, but I don''t think it worked.  This is obviously a domestic animal that has been well cared for.  It doesn''t have any visible whiskers which means it was shaved, and the mane and forelock are shorn pretty short, and the ears are well trimmed.  This had to have been done by the hand of man (or woman) and so it does not fit the challenge.  I''m giving you a 5 for a beautiful picture, but one that does not seem to fit the challenge.', '2002-12-16 15:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(173507, 9703, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i like how the stream curves through your picture and just disappears in the distance.  also like how it is framed by the tree leaning above it from right to left.  very nice composition that leads the viewer through the picture.  winter is a hard time to take photos, IMO, because you need really crisp blue-sky sunny days for the photos not to look "drab" (that''s not the best word, but i can''t come up with a better one right now).  also know that you don''t have control over the weather (wouldn''t that be cool! ;).  so, in summary, nice composition, but the photo doesn''t "pop" as much as i would like because of the muted tones...</td>', 'challenge met.  i like how the stream curves through your picture and just disappears in the distance.  also like how it is framed by the tree leaning above it from right to left.  very nice composition that leads the viewer through the picture.  winter is a hard time to take photos, IMO, because you need really crisp blue-sky sunny days for the photos not to look "drab" (that''s not the best word, but i can''t come up with a better one right now).  also know that you don''t have control over the weather (wouldn''t that be cool! ;).  so, in summary, nice composition, but the photo doesn''t "pop" as much as i would like because of the muted tones...', '2002-12-16 15:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(173508, 9753, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, this looks like a painting.  Love the way there is no obvious intrusion of man, no footsetps and everything is perfect.  Great job!  definitely fits the challenge, and I like the receding lines of the trees and the way you put this in black and white.  It''s a classic!  Only thing I would say is that the top left looks a little light... not really a lot of definition there but that could have been caused by the weather, or that may have been what you were trying to achieve.  -9 Great Job!</td>', 'Beautiful, this looks like a painting.  Love the way there is no obvious intrusion of man, no footsetps and everything is perfect.  Great job!  definitely fits the challenge, and I like the receding lines of the trees and the way you put this in black and white.  It''s a classic!  Only thing I would say is that the top left looks a little light... not really a lot of definition there but that could have been caused by the weather, or that may have been what you were trying to achieve.  -9 Great Job!', '2002-12-16 15:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(173523, 9721, 4967, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the DOF works on this picture.  Personally I would have gone for either a wider or more shallow DOF on this photo.  it''s kind of in between.  I like the white flowers against the green background.  It is hard to really see the definition of the flowers though.  Pretty good composition.  Also there are some hotspots on the leaves.  I think it fits the challenge.  I''m giving you a 6.</td>', 'I don''t think the DOF works on this picture.  Personally I would have gone for either a wider or more shallow DOF on this photo.  it''s kind of in between.  I like the white flowers against the green background.  It is hard to really see the definition of the flowers though.  Pretty good composition.  Also there are some hotspots on the leaves.  I think it fits the challenge.  I''m giving you a 6.', '2002-12-16 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(173529, 9714, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i think?  is it deception because there''s something we dont'' see or is that simply the name of the falls?  i like the flow of the water through the photo, the long exposure works well.  i would like to see this picture lightened just a little (i just did an "autobalance" in a cheap editor, and it increased the contrast w/out blowing out the white, it popped a bit more).  i would also like the rocks to be very crisp and focused, to contrast with the flowing water.  did you use a tripod?  or would you be able to rest the camera on something?  does your camera have a self-timer?  setting that avoids camera shake from releasing the shutter (even on a tripod).  i''m just speculating here.  please ignore if none of that makes sense for your situation ...</td>', 'challenge met.  i think?  is it deception because there''s something we dont'' see or is that simply the name of the falls?  i like the flow of the water through the photo, the long exposure works well.  i would like to see this picture lightened just a little (i just did an "autobalance" in a cheap editor, and it increased the contrast w/out blowing out the white, it popped a bit more).  i would also like the rocks to be very crisp and focused, to contrast with the flowing water.  did you use a tripod?  or would you be able to rest the camera on something?  does your camera have a self-timer?  setting that avoids camera shake from releasing the shutter (even on a tripod).  i''m just speculating here.  please ignore if none of that makes sense for your situation ...', '2002-12-16 15:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(173533, 9784, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice natural arrangement.</td>', 'Nice natural arrangement.', '2002-12-16 16:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(173536, 9793, 4493, '<td valign="top">Would be a perfect 10 if you could have isolated the light to just the trees with a soild background. The grass makes for some distration in the lower left of the frame.</td>', 'Would be a perfect 10 if you could have isolated the light to just the trees with a soild background. The grass makes for some distration in the lower left of the frame.', '2002-12-16 16:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(173546, 9753, 5082, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... I really feel like I standing in the cold with you as you shot it.</td>', 'Excellent shot... I really feel like I standing in the cold with you as you shot it.', '2002-12-16 16:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(173562, 9761, 2123, '<td valign="top">I''m being decidedly more liberal in interpreting the challenge than some are, but I don''t see how you don''t see human intervention or the hand of man here. ?</td>', 'I''m being decidedly more liberal in interpreting the challenge than some are, but I don''t see how you don''t see human intervention or the hand of man here. ?', '2002-12-16 16:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(173564, 9614, 2123, '<td valign="top">So peaceful and beautiful! 10</td>', 'So peaceful and beautiful! 10', '2002-12-16 16:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(173566, 9707, 2123, '<td valign="top">I love how the top looks almost like a b&amp;w then you get the burst of orange/red at the bottom. 6</td>', 'I love how the top looks almost like a b&w then you get the burst of orange/red at the bottom. 6', '2002-12-16 16:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(173578, 9744, 3080, '<td valign="top">I could say that the only reason that this water looks like this is because of human intervention.  NO WHERE will you find water that naturally occurs like this.  However, I supose if I were to be THAT picky, then I''d have to complain about all the shots cause they were taken with a camera.  So, I wont be.  That being said, I think it''s a nice shot, but I still don''t prefer the water to look like this.  It''s technically well done, but not my cup of tea.  Definately a nature shot for sure.  I think that the lighting is good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  Overall it''s a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I could say that the only reason that this water looks like this is because of human intervention.  NO WHERE will you find water that naturally occurs like this.  However, I supose if I were to be THAT picky, then I''d have to complain about all the shots cause they were taken with a camera.  So, I wont be.  That being said, I think it''s a nice shot, but I still don''t prefer the water to look like this.  It''s technically well done, but not my cup of tea.  Definately a nature shot for sure.  I think that the lighting is good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  Overall it''s a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 16:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(173584, 9655, 3080, '<td valign="top">In my personal opinion, the trees are a bit dark, and the white sky doesn''t appeal to me.  I have that same stupid white sky in my shot too though, so who am I to talk?  I don''t like it in my shot either.  Definately appears to be "non humanly altered". Overall I think it''s an ok shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'In my personal opinion, the trees are a bit dark, and the white sky doesn''t appeal to me.  I have that same stupid white sky in my shot too though, so who am I to talk?  I don''t like it in my shot either.  Definately appears to be "non humanly altered". Overall I think it''s an ok shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(173587, 9820, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice job of getting only nature in the shot.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  The focus seems a bit soft.  Not just on the water (which is just fine) but on the moss and leaves too.  Lighting looks ok for the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice job of getting only nature in the shot.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  The focus seems a bit soft.  Not just on the water (which is just fine) but on the moss and leaves too.  Lighting looks ok for the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 16:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(173591, 9746, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Nice and crisp and clear.  The lighting is great. I like the light clouds mixed with the dark clouds, and the blue is a great shade.  I like how the entire photo is filled with the subject.  Great sky-scape. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  Nice and crisp and clear.  The lighting is great. I like the light clouds mixed with the dark clouds, and the blue is a great shade.  I like how the entire photo is filled with the subject.  Great sky-scape. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 16:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(173601, 9654, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this. The perspective is very nice.  Great use of black and white.  I wonder if you will get complaints about how this doesn''t naturally appear in black and white.  oh well, I supose if you were picky, but I''m not, so I like it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice texture.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this. The perspective is very nice.  Great use of black and white.  I wonder if you will get complaints about how this doesn''t naturally appear in black and white.  oh well, I supose if you were picky, but I''m not, so I like it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 16:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(173602, 9663, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!  I love the weeds being silhouetted against that wonderful sunset.  Definately appears to be untouched by human hands. The angle and framing/cropping are good in my opinion.  Beautiful color.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty!  I love the weeds being silhouetted against that wonderful sunset.  Definately appears to be untouched by human hands. The angle and framing/cropping are good in my opinion.  Beautiful color.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 16:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(173613, 9649, 3080, '<td valign="top">This seems a tad bit grainy to me.  Might just be my eyes though.  Otherwise, I really think this is neat.  I like the way it looks like glass.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus seems very nice as well.  The color is very nice.  Great lighting as well.  Definately looks untouched by man.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This seems a tad bit grainy to me.  Might just be my eyes though.  Otherwise, I really think this is neat.  I like the way it looks like glass.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus seems very nice as well.  The color is very nice.  Great lighting as well.  Definately looks untouched by man.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 16:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(173619, 9643, 5695, '<td valign="top">Nature frozen in time.. Simply amazing</td>', 'Nature frozen in time.. Simply amazing', '2002-12-16 16:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(173659, 9700, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  very fitting entry for this time of year :) .  i like the red&amp;green as both a background and additional color.  the pine cone makes a nice subject, good color.  some of the berries (especially that cluster to the lower left of the cone) would be even better if in focus, but your camera''s DOF limits may not have allowed that.</td>', 'challenge met.  very fitting entry for this time of year :) .  i like the red&green as both a background and additional color.  the pine cone makes a nice subject, good color.  some of the berries (especially that cluster to the lower left of the cone) would be even better if in focus, but your camera''s DOF limits may not have allowed that.', '2002-12-16 16:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(173669, 9711, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what this is.  It''s a bit confusing, but it looks like maybe a stream, or brook.  The blown out highlights in the upper right corner are distracting in my opinion, however, this doesn''t look like it was an easy shot to get.  the focus appears to be good.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what this is.  It''s a bit confusing, but it looks like maybe a stream, or brook.  The blown out highlights in the upper right corner are distracting in my opinion, however, this doesn''t look like it was an easy shot to get.  the focus appears to be good.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 16:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(173672, 9789, 3080, '<td valign="top">What excelent focus and clarity.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  I think that the lighting was also very good for this shot.  You have done an excelent job with this.  One of my favorite this week.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What excelent focus and clarity.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  I think that the lighting was also very good for this shot.  You have done an excelent job with this.  One of my favorite this week.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 17:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(173684, 9703, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like how you have the tree going across the top of the photo.  That''s pretty nice.  The angle and framing/croppig you have chosen is nice too.  The focus seems just a tad soft, but I think I have the same problem in my shot, so who am I to talk.  lol.  Overall it''s a nice shot.  definately appears untouched by man.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like how you have the tree going across the top of the photo.  That''s pretty nice.  The angle and framing/croppig you have chosen is nice too.  The focus seems just a tad soft, but I think I have the same problem in my shot, so who am I to talk.  lol.  Overall it''s a nice shot.  definately appears untouched by man.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(173685, 9730, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definatly blue!  I like how you have the bird in the shot.  I think that that really makes the photo for me.  The angle and framig/cropping is great. I like how you have the bird off to the side and not dead center.  The color of the sky is great, and not washed out at all.  Definately not touched by man.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definatly blue!  I like how you have the bird in the shot.  I think that that really makes the photo for me.  The angle and framig/cropping is great. I like how you have the bird off to the side and not dead center.  The color of the sky is great, and not washed out at all.  Definately not touched by man.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-16 17:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(173700, 9759, 3575, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and colors. I''m not sure what that lump is coming out of the tree trunk. Well exposed.</td>', 'Great DOF and colors. I''m not sure what that lump is coming out of the tree trunk. Well exposed.', '2002-12-16 17:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(173703, 9815, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful reflection! It looks like there is a little snow on the banks!  I would like to see a little more clarity, especially on the left side because I find myself squinting to make it out.</td>', 'Wonderful reflection! It looks like there is a little snow on the banks!  I would like to see a little more clarity, especially on the left side because I find myself squinting to make it out.', '2002-12-16 17:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(173704, 9711, 3575, '<td valign="top">Incredible looking ice! looks like a bunch of bubbles flash frozen. Really interesting photo. I can''t quite make out what the green is buy could be my eyes or my monitor.</td>', 'Incredible looking ice! looks like a bunch of bubbles flash frozen. Really interesting photo. I can''t quite make out what the green is buy could be my eyes or my monitor.', '2002-12-16 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(173706, 9680, 3575, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!! I love this! First of all, finding holly in the wild is a feat in itself, I think. Second, to find it in this frozen state is another. Technically perfect.</td>', 'Fantastic!! I love this! First of all, finding holly in the wild is a feat in itself, I think. Second, to find it in this frozen state is another. Technically perfect.', '2002-12-16 17:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(173707, 9766, 5495, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a truly desolate landscape......keep up the good work (and keep hiking!).....</td>', 'Nice photo of a truly desolate landscape......keep up the good work (and keep hiking!).....', '2002-12-16 17:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(173708, 9783, 3575, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Isn''t it great to be able to submit these interesting sizes?  I probably would have cropped out the branches on the left because they draw my eye over there too much. Beautiful though.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Isn''t it great to be able to submit these interesting sizes?  I probably would have cropped out the branches on the left because they draw my eye over there too much. Beautiful though.', '2002-12-16 17:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
