(173791, 9761, 3575, '<td valign="top">Look at the awe in those girls\'' eyes!  It\''s a stretch to fit this into this week\''s challenge though because everything in this photo is a result of man\''s influence. It\''s a very cute photograph with good lighting. The third little girl is obscured by the red suited guy though. One of my favorite parts of this photo is the little blond girl in the back of the lline and seeing her excitement and anticipation all over her face. This is a very emotive photograph.</td>', 'Look at the awe in those girls\'' eyes!  It\''s a stretch to fit this into this week\''s challenge though because everything in this photo is a result of man\''s influence. It\''s a very cute photograph with good lighting. The third little girl is obscured by the red suited guy though. One of my favorite parts of this photo is the little blond girl in the back of the lline and seeing her excitement and anticipation all over her face. This is a very emotive photograph.', '2002-12-16 20:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
