(174173, 9711, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice set of textures to play with there. The eye goes in all direction in this composition trying to find a strong detail to rest on.</td>', 'Nice set of textures to play with there. The eye goes in all direction in this composition trying to find a strong detail to rest on.', '2002-12-17 09:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(174179, 9608, 3585, '<td valign="top">Not quite true, my roof and stone walls are covered with these creatures. its the quality of the air that is the key factor for their survival. Nice capture, could have been taken closer to the center of interest though.</td>', 'Not quite true, my roof and stone walls are covered with these creatures. its the quality of the air that is the key factor for their survival. Nice capture, could have been taken closer to the center of interest though.', '2002-12-17 09:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(174184, 9729, 4510, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, but I don''t think a domesticated animal fits the challenge.</td>', 'Clever shot, but I don''t think a domesticated animal fits the challenge.', '2002-12-17 09:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(174185, 9783, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice sinuous lines and tonal mix in the background. The vegetal composition is not quite solid enough to fill this challenging format.</td>', 'Nice sinuous lines and tonal mix in the background. The vegetal composition is not quite solid enough to fill this challenging format.', '2002-12-17 09:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(174191, 9630, 2123, '<td valign="top">I see where you''re going with this, but there was *some* human intervention needed to create a child. :-)</td>', 'I see where you''re going with this, but there was *some* human intervention needed to create a child. :-)', '2002-12-17 09:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(174192, 9790, 2123, '<td valign="top">There is really not enough here to engage the eye.  The color is dull and I can''t tell if it''s in focus or not - because there''s really nothing to focus on.</td>', 'There is really not enough here to engage the eye.  The color is dull and I can''t tell if it''s in focus or not - because there''s really nothing to focus on.', '2002-12-17 09:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(174194, 9758, 2123, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique, but I would have preferred to see just one of these shots at normal size.  This makes me feel like I''m a fly or something. :-)</td>', 'Interesting technique, but I would have preferred to see just one of these shots at normal size.  This makes me feel like I''m a fly or something. :-)', '2002-12-17 09:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(174200, 9729, 1024, '<td valign="top">This may be the best of the best in this challenge.  The reflection of the steer looks so surreal, it gives a feeling of other-worldliness.  This is a photograph that I would be proud to hang in my house.  Well done.  (Sorry I could not offer any constructive critisism, there is nothing I would change).</td>', 'This may be the best of the best in this challenge.  The reflection of the steer looks so surreal, it gives a feeling of other-worldliness.  This is a photograph that I would be proud to hang in my house.  Well done.  (Sorry I could not offer any constructive critisism, there is nothing I would change).', '2002-12-17 10:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(174226, 9783, 5082, '<td valign="top">Best shot of the bunch... a 10 if I could vote for it.</td>', 'Best shot of the bunch... a 10 if I could vote for it.', '2002-12-17 11:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(174245, 9753, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i really like how the trees seem to be fading into the background ... as if they are going on forever.  truly w/out the hand of man!  i also like the contrast between the dark rocks and trees and the white snow, you have achieved a very good tonal range here w/out blowing anything out.  the only small criticism i have (and that''s not even part of the photo and just personal taste) is the small white border.  i feel it should be larger or not there at all.  it also somehow looks wider at the bottom than on the sides (optical illusion, i''m sure).  overall, nice entry!</td>', 'challenge met.  i really like how the trees seem to be fading into the background ... as if they are going on forever.  truly w/out the hand of man!  i also like the contrast between the dark rocks and trees and the white snow, you have achieved a very good tonal range here w/out blowing anything out.  the only small criticism i have (and that''s not even part of the photo and just personal taste) is the small white border.  i feel it should be larger or not there at all.  it also somehow looks wider at the bottom than on the sides (optical illusion, i''m sure).  overall, nice entry!', '2002-12-17 12:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(174257, 9636, 4493, '<td valign="top">I really like the feeling of being towered over by the trees. Nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the feeling of being towered over by the trees. Nice shot.', '2002-12-17 12:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(174264, 9676, 5703, '<td valign="top">Great one.</td>', 'Great one.', '2002-12-17 12:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(174269, 9649, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really neat picture, maybe a tad grainy, but intensely cool anyway.  9 Swash</td>', 'Really neat picture, maybe a tad grainy, but intensely cool anyway.  9 Swash', '2002-12-17 13:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(174320, 9590, 5490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Photo!  Perfect balance between the bright whites and the dark shadows, no washout and plenty of detail in the shadows.  the splash of color makes it perfect!</td>', 'Beautiful Photo!  Perfect balance between the bright whites and the dark shadows, no washout and plenty of detail in the shadows.  the splash of color makes it perfect!', '2002-12-17 15:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(174322, 9663, 5490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Colors, great contrast, excellent detail and most of all, perfect composition!  Very excellent photo!</td>', 'Beautiful Colors, great contrast, excellent detail and most of all, perfect composition!  Very excellent photo!', '2002-12-17 15:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(174324, 9700, 5490, '<td valign="top">Superb composition and even better DOF!  Love the crisp details and the great natural colors....absolutely beautiful macro!!</td>', 'Superb composition and even better DOF!  Love the crisp details and the great natural colors....absolutely beautiful macro!!', '2002-12-17 15:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(174326, 9649, 5490, '<td valign="top">Very pretty closeup!  Very good composition and handled the lighting perfectly.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Very pretty closeup!  Very good composition and handled the lighting perfectly.  Nice shot!', '2002-12-17 15:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(174329, 9759, 5490, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and i love the color tones in this photo!  Exceptional detail and DOF alson.  Excellent photo!</td>', 'Very nice composition and i love the color tones in this photo!  Exceptional detail and DOF alson.  Excellent photo!', '2002-12-17 15:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(174331, 9636, 5490, '<td valign="top">Very well executed.  Nice composition and good detail in the backlit branches.  feels like laying on my back in the leaves  :-)</td>', 'Very well executed.  Nice composition and good detail in the backlit branches.  feels like laying on my back in the leaves  :-)', '2002-12-17 15:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(174332, 9643, 5490, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed.  A very good capture and composed nicely.</td>', 'Nicely executed.  A very good capture and composed nicely.', '2002-12-17 16:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(174333, 9755, 5490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and excellent composition!</td>', 'Nice capture and excellent composition!', '2002-12-17 16:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(174334, 9784, 5490, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and excellent DOF!  Very good b&amp;w!</td>', 'Very nicely composed and excellent DOF!  Very good b&w!', '2002-12-17 16:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(174336, 9680, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool image!  Freezing rain might be hard on the plants, but it sure produces some very cool effects.  I like how the holly berry is frozen to the leaf.  The droplet on the right is a nice feature, too.  The other reflections in the ice are also nice features, too.  Easy 9!  Swash</td>', 'Cool image!  Freezing rain might be hard on the plants, but it sure produces some very cool effects.  I like how the holly berry is frozen to the leaf.  The droplet on the right is a nice feature, too.  The other reflections in the ice are also nice features, too.  Easy 9!  Swash', '2002-12-17 16:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(174338, 9643, 1005, '<td valign="top">Freezing rain makes for very cool photo subjects, but hard on the plants.  I like this view very much.  The droplet coming off the berry creates some nice reflections.  9 Swash</td>', 'Freezing rain makes for very cool photo subjects, but hard on the plants.  I like this view very much.  The droplet coming off the berry creates some nice reflections.  9 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(174340, 9809, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot!  Nice details, esp. the scaling of the leaf/branches.  This is a hard shot due to the wild amount of DOF needed to make everybody happy.  I think this is very well done.  9 Swash</td>', 'Really neat shot!  Nice details, esp. the scaling of the leaf/branches.  This is a hard shot due to the wild amount of DOF needed to make everybody happy.  I think this is very well done.  9 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(174342, 9783, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice panaramic view.  The branch on the right is more distracting than value added, IMO.  Did you try a fill flash to illuminate the foreground branch?  That would have changed the sillhouette to a colored sillhouette, might have been a little more surreal.  (Just a thought.)  9 Swash</td>', 'Nice panaramic view.  The branch on the right is more distracting than value added, IMO.  Did you try a fill flash to illuminate the foreground branch?  That would have changed the sillhouette to a colored sillhouette, might have been a little more surreal.  (Just a thought.)  9 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(174347, 9684, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, did you have to climb the neighboring tree?  (risking your camera?)  I like this shot very much.  Great title.  9 Swash</td>', 'Sweet shot, did you have to climb the neighboring tree?  (risking your camera?)  I like this shot very much.  Great title.  9 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:12:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(174350, 9663, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot.  The grass silhouettes are wonderful.  Nice color.  I would have been tempted to crop another 5 percent off the bottom, due the coloration in the lower right corner, but it doesn''t distract hugely.  9 Swash</td>', 'Really neat shot.  The grass silhouettes are wonderful.  Nice color.  I would have been tempted to crop another 5 percent off the bottom, due the coloration in the lower right corner, but it doesn''t distract hugely.  9 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(174353, 9744, 1005, '<td valign="top">Always love these blurred, running water shots.  Nice setting.  No matter how many times I see this effect, it always wows me.  9 Swash</td>', 'Always love these blurred, running water shots.  Nice setting.  No matter how many times I see this effect, it always wows me.  9 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(174356, 9824, 1005, '<td valign="top">Arrgggh, isn''t that tree a bit big for a beaver?  Great shot.  Love the wood chips.  I wonder how long it took to cut this deeply?  I always thought they went for trees they could "manage".  Nice framing.  Too bad you didn''t "catch him in the act"!  (Now that''s asking for the sun, moon and everything!)  9 Swash</td>', 'Arrgggh, isn''t that tree a bit big for a beaver?  Great shot.  Love the wood chips.  I wonder how long it took to cut this deeply?  I always thought they went for trees they could "manage".  Nice framing.  Too bad you didn''t "catch him in the act"!  (Now that''s asking for the sun, moon and everything!)  9 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(174362, 9777, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but it needs more punch.  How about turning up the red channel several notches and saturate, it would make the clouds stand out more strikingly, IMO.  7 Swash</td>', 'Pretty, but it needs more punch.  How about turning up the red channel several notches and saturate, it would make the clouds stand out more strikingly, IMO.  7 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(174365, 9791, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but it needs more interest.  The sun glare is overpowering.  Nice branches.  7 Swash</td>', 'Pretty, but it needs more interest.  The sun glare is overpowering.  Nice branches.  7 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(174369, 9793, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, but very grainy on my monitor.  The tree trunks seem more dotted than hard edges.  7 Swash</td>', 'Interesting view, but very grainy on my monitor.  The tree trunks seem more dotted than hard edges.  7 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(174394, 9821, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but the haze is very distracting.  Did you shoot this out of a window?  I see two bars that look like florescent light fixtures and other misc. reflections, not good.  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice sky, but the haze is very distracting.  Did you shoot this out of a window?  I see two bars that look like florescent light fixtures and other misc. reflections, not good.  7 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(174396, 9790, 1005, '<td valign="top">Surprising, but I can see the outline of the frog better in the smaller view.  Interesting idea, but to me, it needed more light to show off the frog better.<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Surprising, but I can see the outline of the frog better in the smaller view.  Interesting idea, but to me, it needed more light to show off the frog better.7 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(174404, 9784, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, good contrasts, but for me, it''s a bit low on the wow/interest.  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo, good contrasts, but for me, it''s a bit low on the wow/interest.  7 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(174406, 9627, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, good contrasts, but low on the interest/wow scale.  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo, good contrasts, but low on the interest/wow scale.  7 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(174407, 9696, 1005, '<td valign="top">The silhouetted bird (crow?) doesn''t offer enough to wow me.  7 Swash</td>', 'The silhouetted bird (crow?) doesn''t offer enough to wow me.  7 Swash', '2002-12-17 16:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(174430, 9815, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, really good reflections!  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, really good reflections!  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 17:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(174431, 9655, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like how these two trees are "standing guard" over the forest.  Sort of reminds me of a chapter in the Two Towers.  (Can''t wait to see the movie!)  Were I to suggest any change, try creeping up closer to the trees and lowering your shooting angle, it would make the trees seem "larger than life".  8 Swash</td>', 'I like how these two trees are "standing guard" over the forest.  Sort of reminds me of a chapter in the Two Towers.  (Can''t wait to see the movie!)  Were I to suggest any change, try creeping up closer to the trees and lowering your shooting angle, it would make the trees seem "larger than life".  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 17:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(174432, 9740, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like your framing, the use of just one tree, the dramatic sky background, all very nice!  8 Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  I like your framing, the use of just one tree, the dramatic sky background, all very nice!  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 17:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(174433, 9707, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors.  Great choice of trees, very stoic, yet almost brutal.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice fall colors.  Great choice of trees, very stoic, yet almost brutal.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 17:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(174434, 9644, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Good lighting.  (looks like a dribble on the black background materiel, dead center between the antlers.  Very good focus.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot!  Good lighting.  (looks like a dribble on the black background materiel, dead center between the antlers.  Very good focus.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 17:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(174435, 9812, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice find!  I really like the stone embedded in the stone.  The flash glare is a bit strong in places.  I kinda question the "extra" elements, the pine cone, the shell piece(?), but not enough to really drop your score.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice find!  I really like the stone embedded in the stone.  The flash glare is a bit strong in places.  I kinda question the "extra" elements, the pine cone, the shell piece(?), but not enough to really drop your score.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 17:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(174436, 9677, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The moon really looks cool between these clouds.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice composition.  The moon really looks cool between these clouds.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 17:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(174437, 9590, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece.  I''m not crazy about your framing, but I don''t count that as part of the pic (it''s too long at the bottom and top or not wide enough on the sides)  I really like how brightly colored the leaf seems.  8 Swash</td>', 'Interesting piece.  I''m not crazy about your framing, but I don''t count that as part of the pic (it''s too long at the bottom and top or not wide enough on the sides)  I really like how brightly colored the leaf seems.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(174438, 9707, 3080, '<td valign="top">This was a bad challenge to have in the wintertime.  Naked trees aren''t the most exciting things in the world. (hey, I submitted one too)  This definately goes with the challenge, and the angle and framig/cropping are good.  The focus seems good on the tree.  Kind of a dreary day for pics, but lighting is still ok.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This was a bad challenge to have in the wintertime.  Naked trees aren''t the most exciting things in the world. (hey, I submitted one too)  This definately goes with the challenge, and the angle and framig/cropping are good.  The focus seems good on the tree.  Kind of a dreary day for pics, but lighting is still ok.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-17 18:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(174439, 9643, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the use of DOF here, and the focus and clarity are really good.  The color is perfect.  Definately looks untouched by man.  Angle and framing/cropping are really great as well.  One of my favorites this week.  Great way to blurr the background.  Nothing is distracting from the subject.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the use of DOF here, and the focus and clarity are really good.  The color is perfect.  Definately looks untouched by man.  Angle and framing/cropping are really great as well.  One of my favorites this week.  Great way to blurr the background.  Nothing is distracting from the subject.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-17 18:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(174440, 9753, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice postcard look.  I really like how the cloudy skies are pushing down on the scene.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very nice postcard look.  I really like how the cloudy skies are pushing down on the scene.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(174442, 9774, 3080, '<td valign="top">What in the heck is that??  strange looking thing.  Anyway, I like the uniformity of color.  The brown theme works nicely.  the subject is quite interesting indeed, and it appears to be untouched by man.  All the foot prints look like animals and everything.  Lighting is nice as well.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What in the heck is that??  strange looking thing.  Anyway, I like the uniformity of color.  The brown theme works nicely.  the subject is quite interesting indeed, and it appears to be untouched by man.  All the foot prints look like animals and everything.  Lighting is nice as well.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-17 18:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(174443, 9608, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like this scene, but less than crazy about the angle/DOF.  I know a flatter angle to the branch would be more boring, but does increase the amount of subject in focus.  It''s not upsetting enough to really drop your score for me.  8 Swash<br/>(Oh I really like the leaf in the upper right corner!)</td>', 'I like this scene, but less than crazy about the angle/DOF.  I know a flatter angle to the branch would be more boring, but does increase the amount of subject in focus.  It''s not upsetting enough to really drop your score for me.  8 Swash(Oh I really like the leaf in the upper right corner!)', '2002-12-17 18:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(174449, 9812, 3080, '<td valign="top">A very interesting find indeed!  I love the colors and the rock in front is just great!  I only wish that the focus had been a bit better on the rock in front and the pinecone.  Otherwise, angle and framing/cropping are great, and the lighting is nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very interesting find indeed!  I love the colors and the rock in front is just great!  I only wish that the focus had been a bit better on the rock in front and the pinecone.  Otherwise, angle and framing/cropping are great, and the lighting is nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-17 18:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(174450, 9684, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a great "untouched by man" photo.  my only complaint is the blown out branches toward the bottom.  Otherwise, the angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus is great.  The lighting on the subject its self is good as well.  Great find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great "untouched by man" photo.  my only complaint is the blown out branches toward the bottom.  Otherwise, the angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus is great.  The lighting on the subject its self is good as well.  Great find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-17 18:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(174451, 9680, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wish that a bit more of the holy was in focus.  As is, the entire right side of the photo is soft focus, and I think that''s uninteresting.  However, I really like the subject, and I think that the lighting and focus on the subject is good.  The angle and framing/cropping is alright as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I wish that a bit more of the holy was in focus.  As is, the entire right side of the photo is soft focus, and I think that''s uninteresting.  However, I really like the subject, and I think that the lighting and focus on the subject is good.  The angle and framing/cropping is alright as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-17 18:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(174457, 9730, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, cormorant I think.  It''s a tad dark, but really cool.  8 Swash</td>', 'Lovely shot, cormorant I think.  It''s a tad dark, but really cool.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(174458, 9819, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  Really like the rushing water.  Good focus and color.  8 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot!  Really like the rushing water.  Good focus and color.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(174460, 9789, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  I question the sepia, but it''s not bad.  Interesting view.  8 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot!  I question the sepia, but it''s not bad.  Interesting view.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(174461, 9722, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I like the little bit of life showing up in the hardest places.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot!  I like the little bit of life showing up in the hardest places.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(174462, 9681, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  I think I would have liked more droplets, but what can you do?  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot!  I think I would have liked more droplets, but what can you do?  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(174464, 9711, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great catch, good eye.  I really like how the ice seems to be bubbling.  8 Swash</td>', 'Great catch, good eye.  I really like how the ice seems to be bubbling.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(174465, 9755, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, did you take the branch inside?  While I like the absense of background, I think I would have liked seeing the branch in it''s environment.  It''s a great shot anyway.  8 Swash</td>', 'Cool shot, did you take the branch inside?  While I like the absense of background, I think I would have liked seeing the branch in it''s environment.  It''s a great shot anyway.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(174466, 9757, 4648, '<td valign="top">This a a most beautiful bird.  Is he yours?  I hope you have a photo of all of him.  The focus is sharp and the colors are so deep.  I love the background out of focus.  All your attention is on the bird himself.  Those eyes, excuse me, that eye is beautiful.  This should place or these people are crazy.  Fantastic photo!</td>', 'This a a most beautiful bird.  Is he yours?  I hope you have a photo of all of him.  The focus is sharp and the colors are so deep.  I love the background out of focus.  All your attention is on the bird himself.  Those eyes, excuse me, that eye is beautiful.  This should place or these people are crazy.  Fantastic photo!', '2002-12-17 18:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(174467, 9790, 4648, '<td valign="top">Dig him up and thaw him out - he might live.  This is vry unique and comes through very clearly with the exception of all of his left legs.  But I can definitely tell what it is, or isn''t anymore.  I like it but don''t think it will do well here.  To me it''s an 8.  PTL</td>', 'Dig him up and thaw him out - he might live.  This is vry unique and comes through very clearly with the exception of all of his left legs.  But I can definitely tell what it is, or isn''t anymore.  I like it but don''t think it will do well here.  To me it''s an 8.  PTL', '2002-12-17 18:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(174470, 9684, 4648, '<td valign="top">Dangerous getting high enough to photograph into this home.  But you did a great job.  This photo technically has it right plus to me it has interest and appeal.  Wonder what kind of bird lived there, where is he/she now, how many babies did they have?  Good photojournal shot in my opinion also.  Should do well in this challenge.  I''d give it an 8.  PTL</td>', 'Dangerous getting high enough to photograph into this home.  But you did a great job.  This photo technically has it right plus to me it has interest and appeal.  Wonder what kind of bird lived there, where is he/she now, how many babies did they have?  Good photojournal shot in my opinion also.  Should do well in this challenge.  I''d give it an 8.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(174471, 9714, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but in this case, the rushing water seems less than focussed.  Plus there are a couple of "anomolies" that I am having trouble with.  Ex:  Middle right side of the falls, there appears to be a white streak?  Still, I like this enough to give it an 8.  Swash</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but in this case, the rushing water seems less than focussed.  Plus there are a couple of "anomolies" that I am having trouble with.  Ex:  Middle right side of the falls, there appears to be a white streak?  Still, I like this enough to give it an 8.  Swash', '2002-12-17 19:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(174472, 9614, 4648, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W did not do this horse justice.  It is a beautiful photo and horse and should have been in color to contrast his white against the setting.  I do like the nice tight crop, brings out the face so beautifully.  I also like the softness to the photo - to me it adds at least 2 points.  Color would have added 2 more points.  The face is so serene, peaceful, and gentle looking.  Awesome job.  I''d give it a 7 - 9 if in color.  PTL</td>', 'B&W did not do this horse justice.  It is a beautiful photo and horse and should have been in color to contrast his white against the setting.  I do like the nice tight crop, brings out the face so beautifully.  I also like the softness to the photo - to me it adds at least 2 points.  Color would have added 2 more points.  The face is so serene, peaceful, and gentle looking.  Awesome job.  I''d give it a 7 - 9 if in color.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(174473, 9703, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  You have 3 things that really make it a photo and not just a picture.  1.  The snow on the ground.  2.  the curve in the creek.  and 3.  the tree laying across the creek.  These three things add so much to the shot.  If you could only have had a little sky.  Don''t want much do I?  It''s an 8 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'This is wonderful.  You have 3 things that really make it a photo and not just a picture.  1.  The snow on the ground.  2.  the curve in the creek.  and 3.  the tree laying across the creek.  These three things add so much to the shot.  If you could only have had a little sky.  Don''t want much do I?  It''s an 8 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(174474, 9636, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like how the trees are all coming in from the edges.  Really nice.  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'I really like how the trees are all coming in from the edges.  Really nice.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(174475, 9748, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Were the clouds moving at all?  If so, try a longer exposure with a large F-stop.  It''s a cool effect that I''m trying to perfect.  8 Swash</td>', 'Cool shot!  Were the clouds moving at all?  If so, try a longer exposure with a large F-stop.  It''s a cool effect that I''m trying to perfect.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(174476, 9815, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections.  They are actually prettier than the real things.  I sound like a broken record - should have been in color, would have added 2 more points and would make a beautiful painting on the wall.  Again, the reflections make it.  A 7 from me in B&amp;W.  PTL</td>', 'Beautiful reflections.  They are actually prettier than the real things.  I sound like a broken record - should have been in color, would have added 2 more points and would make a beautiful painting on the wall.  Again, the reflections make it.  A 7 from me in B&W.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(174477, 9812, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your focus appears a little out to me.    It also looks darker on the righr side, other that that fits the challenge and is interesting shot.</td>', 'Your focus appears a little out to me.    It also looks darker on the righr side, other that that fits the challenge and is interesting shot.', '2002-12-17 19:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(174478, 9772, 1202, '<td valign="top">If the fungi is the growth on the tree, then you missed the most interesting big blue leaf.   Not knowing for sure which is your main subject it leaves me kind of empty.   I think the big blue leaf would make a great shot by itself.</td>', 'If the fungi is the growth on the tree, then you missed the most interesting big blue leaf.   Not knowing for sure which is your main subject it leaves me kind of empty.   I think the big blue leaf would make a great shot by itself.', '2002-12-17 19:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(174479, 9761, 4648, '<td valign="top">What a shame the 2 adults are behind the children.  The looks on the faces of the children at Santa, plus those in line, are tops.  The awe in the face of the  little girls in red can''t be expressed in words.  You titled it correctly.  Wonderful job.  Would be an 8 from me.   PTL</td>', 'What a shame the 2 adults are behind the children.  The looks on the faces of the children at Santa, plus those in line, are tops.  The awe in the face of the  little girls in red can''t be expressed in words.  You titled it correctly.  Wonderful job.  Would be an 8 from me.   PTL', '2002-12-17 19:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(174480, 9680, 1202, '<td valign="top">I can''t seem to get my eyes to focus on any one subject.   The pale Holly leaf is clearest to me but still out.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'I can''t seem to get my eyes to focus on any one subject.   The pale Holly leaf is clearest to me but still out.  Interesting shot.', '2002-12-17 19:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(174481, 9752, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good choice of border.  I think this might have worked a tiny bit better with just one tree in the frame, but the others don''t "ruin" it.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, good choice of border.  I think this might have worked a tiny bit better with just one tree in the frame, but the others don''t "ruin" it.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(174482, 9681, 1202, '<td valign="top">The bright spots in the background are bothersome to me.   I hope you got a real nice macro of the drip by itself, as I find it a stand alone subject.</td>', 'The bright spots in the background are bothersome to me.   I hope you got a real nice macro of the drip by itself, as I find it a stand alone subject.', '2002-12-17 19:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(174483, 9810, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool coloration, were the rocks really THIS red?  Strong blue sky!  8 Swash</td>', 'Cool coloration, were the rocks really THIS red?  Strong blue sky!  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(174484, 9781, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great title, focus seems slightly soft.  cool idea.  8 Swash</td>', 'Great title, focus seems slightly soft.  cool idea.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(174485, 9654, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  F-64 would have been nice here, but the camera do have their limits. <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot!  F-64 would have been nice here, but the camera do have their limits. 8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(174486, 9730, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great composition but I would like it a lot lighter, to see the colors of the bird, and his beauty contrasted against the cold sky.  Still would give it a 6.  PTL</td>', 'Great composition but I would like it a lot lighter, to see the colors of the bird, and his beauty contrasted against the cold sky.  Still would give it a 6.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(174487, 9755, 1202, '<td valign="top">Wonderful build up of ice and a great job of capturing it.  Nice composition too.</td>', 'Wonderful build up of ice and a great job of capturing it.  Nice composition too.', '2002-12-17 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
