(174489, 9714, 4648, '<td valign="top">Need a lot more focus to really bet the fullness of this.  And need to be lighter.  I''d give it a 5 because of the interest.  PTL</td>', 'Need a lot more focus to really bet the fullness of this.  And need to be lighter.  I''d give it a 5 because of the interest.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(174490, 9676, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  The minerals in the water make the rocks a great redish color.  8 Swash</td>', 'Cool shot!  The minerals in the water make the rocks a great redish color.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(174491, 9700, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. this seems to be two trees growing together, but it makes for a nice set of colors.  Very good shot.  The pinecone in the lower center is a very nice touch.  8 Swash</td>', 'O.K. this seems to be two trees growing together, but it makes for a nice set of colors.  Very good shot.  The pinecone in the lower center is a very nice touch.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(174492, 9784, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot and nice in B&amp;W.   Is that a coin over on the right side about  halfway back?   Just kidding.</td>', 'Very interesting shot and nice in B&W.   Is that a coin over on the right side about  halfway back?   Just kidding.', '2002-12-17 19:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(174493, 9713, 1005, '<td valign="top">Keep searching....(You might want to try a little lower!)  Neat shot, nice sun rays, interesting clouds.   Less than a total fan of sepia for this, but it''s not horrible or anything.  8 Swash</td>', 'Keep searching....(You might want to try a little lower!)  Neat shot, nice sun rays, interesting clouds.   Less than a total fan of sepia for this, but it''s not horrible or anything.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(174494, 9703, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Full, yet fairly calm stream.  I really like the trees hanging over the stream.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot.  Full, yet fairly calm stream.  I really like the trees hanging over the stream.  8 Swash', '2002-12-17 19:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(174495, 9746, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice cloud formation.   I wish the blue could have been a little brighter.</td>', 'Nice cloud formation.   I wish the blue could have been a little brighter.', '2002-12-17 19:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(174496, 9654, 4648, '<td valign="top">Your title is wrong.  This is EverBlack&amp;White.  Your title suggests a color shot, and it should have been.  It also needs focus.  Only one little section of the tree is in focus.  It also need to be lighter at the top and is almost blown out at the bottom.  This would get a score of maybe 2 0r 3 from me.  PTL</td>', 'Your title is wrong.  This is EverBlack&White.  Your title suggests a color shot, and it should have been.  It also needs focus.  Only one little section of the tree is in focus.  It also need to be lighter at the top and is almost blown out at the bottom.  This would get a score of maybe 2 0r 3 from me.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(174497, 9752, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice wintery scene, but it just doesn''t excite me much.  Maybe it would have been better if the tree top had been left in.</td>', 'Nice wintery scene, but it just doesn''t excite me much.  Maybe it would have been better if the tree top had been left in.', '2002-12-17 19:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(174499, 9714, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, if this is Deception Falls on Hwy 2 -- I''ve been there! I took my first waterfall shot up there. I don''t know why the water looks brown? I''m anxious to find out what technique you used, shutter speed, filters, etc. I really love this shot, just wish it wasn''t so dark.</td>', 'Wow, if this is Deception Falls on Hwy 2 -- I''ve been there! I took my first waterfall shot up there. I don''t know why the water looks brown? I''m anxious to find out what technique you used, shutter speed, filters, etc. I really love this shot, just wish it wasn''t so dark.', '2002-12-17 19:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(174500, 9758, 4648, '<td valign="top">Will my digital that does a short movie print this out also?  This is awesome.  Good one.  The background is really a little too green, but you can''t help that a lot.  Good focus on the bird and branch.  Should do well this challenge.  PTL</td>', 'Will my digital that does a short movie print this out also?  This is awesome.  Good one.  The background is really a little too green, but you can''t help that a lot.  Good focus on the bird and branch.  Should do well this challenge.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(174502, 9757, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject, but I think it would have been so much better if the beak and some of its feathers had not been so blown out.   NIce use of DOF.</td>', 'This is a great subject, but I think it would have been so much better if the beak and some of its feathers had not been so blown out.   NIce use of DOF.', '2002-12-17 19:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(174503, 9774, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  What animal is this.  He sure is looking you straight in the eyes.  Hope you had a long zoom to get this, or are a good runner.  The technical points are all there, and I especially like the cropping - that you did not crowd him.  This gave us several colors of brown and different textures.  Congratulations of a 10.</td>', 'I love this shot.  What animal is this.  He sure is looking you straight in the eyes.  Hope you had a long zoom to get this, or are a good runner.  The technical points are all there, and I especially like the cropping - that you did not crowd him.  This gave us several colors of brown and different textures.  Congratulations of a 10.', '2002-12-17 19:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(174504, 9707, 3575, '<td valign="top">What a great tree! I love the silouette against the light sky. I would have liked to top of the tree though. Another thing I really like is the small remnant of Fall colors. You have a great eye, IMHO.</td>', 'What a great tree! I love the silouette against the light sky. I would have liked to top of the tree though. Another thing I really like is the small remnant of Fall colors. You have a great eye, IMHO.', '2002-12-17 19:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(174505, 9761, 1202, '<td valign="top">I bet you got a lot of comments on this one.   Its terribly hard to show the kid''s emotion without missing the challenge.   Sorry!</td>', 'I bet you got a lot of comments on this one.   Its terribly hard to show the kid''s emotion without missing the challenge.   Sorry!', '2002-12-17 19:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(174507, 9700, 3575, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THIS! How perfect for a Holiday Card. I can almost smell the pine. Excellent color saturation and exposure. Nice composition.</td>', 'I LOVE THIS! How perfect for a Holiday Card. I can almost smell the pine. Excellent color saturation and exposure. Nice composition.', '2002-12-17 19:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(174508, 9744, 4648, '<td valign="top">"WOW''!  You sure have the "wow" to this one.  Beautiful colors with nice sharp focus, showing the texture of the rocks beautifully.  And the water appears to be rushing with such a magnitude of force.  This goes in my favorites for sure.  A 10 from me.  PTL</td>', '"WOW''!  You sure have the "wow" to this one.  Beautiful colors with nice sharp focus, showing the texture of the rocks beautifully.  And the water appears to be rushing with such a magnitude of force.  This goes in my favorites for sure.  A 10 from me.  PTL', '2002-12-17 19:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(174509, 9789, 3575, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro! I love the colorization too. Wonderful composition. Perfect DOF.</td>', 'Excellent macro! I love the colorization too. Wonderful composition. Perfect DOF.', '2002-12-17 19:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(174511, 9819, 3575, '<td valign="top">This made me cold. Was it cold? I like the long shutter speed but I especially like the fallen trees and natural debris.</td>', 'This made me cold. Was it cold? I like the long shutter speed but I especially like the fallen trees and natural debris.', '2002-12-17 19:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(174512, 9643, 1202, '<td valign="top">Marvelous!</td>', 'Marvelous!', '2002-12-17 19:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(174514, 9748, 1202, '<td valign="top">A gloomy subject, and it gives me a gloomy feeling.   I think that if the border had been about three times wider it would have given your picture more snap.</td>', 'A gloomy subject, and it gives me a gloomy feeling.   I think that if the border had been about three times wider it would have given your picture more snap.', '2002-12-17 19:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(174515, 9654, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, did you lie on your back to take this or just do a back bend? Really great perspective and the texture of the bark is wonderful. I think your composition is perfect.</td>', 'Wow, did you lie on your back to take this or just do a back bend? Really great perspective and the texture of the bark is wonderful. I think your composition is perfect.', '2002-12-17 19:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(174516, 9608, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I would have lliked more DOF so that I could see more detail on the branch. The colors are amazing and your exposure couldn''t be better.</td>', 'Very interesting. I would have lliked more DOF so that I could see more detail on the branch. The colors are amazing and your exposure couldn''t be better.', '2002-12-17 19:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(174517, 9783, 1202, '<td valign="top">It sure is nice to be able to get away from 649X480!   NIce job, but I think it would have been even better if you had left the tree on the right out of it.</td>', 'It sure is nice to be able to get away from 649X480!   NIce job, but I think it would have been even better if you had left the tree on the right out of it.', '2002-12-17 19:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(174518, 9810, 3575, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine that this rock is naturally this red.  The sky looks artificial too. Really interesting rock formation but I would have liked a more natural look, especially for this challenge.</td>', 'I can''t imagine that this rock is naturally this red.  The sky looks artificial too. Really interesting rock formation but I would have liked a more natural look, especially for this challenge.', '2002-12-17 19:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(174519, 9744, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice motion.   I would like to see it a little lighter, I suppose that was difficult to do with your long exposure.   I just think quite a lot of detail has been lost in the rocks which assist in making the "water" picture.</td>', 'Nice motion.   I would like to see it a little lighter, I suppose that was difficult to do with your long exposure.   I just think quite a lot of detail has been lost in the rocks which assist in making the "water" picture.', '2002-12-17 19:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(174520, 9713, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful above-the-clouds shot. I like the overall gold tone of your photo as well, especially appropriate with your title. Nice job.</td>', 'Wonderful above-the-clouds shot. I like the overall gold tone of your photo as well, especially appropriate with your title. Nice job.', '2002-12-17 19:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(174521, 9789, 1202, '<td valign="top">Sepia is nice but how did it look in color.   I think I would prefer it that way as it shows more warmth than the sepia.</td>', 'Sepia is nice but how did it look in color.   I think I would prefer it that way as it shows more warmth than the sepia.', '2002-12-17 19:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(174523, 9791, 3575, '<td valign="top">Like the color tones and the silouetted tree. Your composition is really well done. I know your title is "the light" but it is the bright spot on this photo that I don''t care for very much. Everything else is really wonderful.</td>', 'Like the color tones and the silouetted tree. Your composition is really well done. I know your title is "the light" but it is the bright spot on this photo that I don''t care for very much. Everything else is really wonderful.', '2002-12-17 19:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(174525, 9696, 3575, '<td valign="top">This is great! The turquoise and black is wonderful. I love the composition. I think the branches took on too much turquoise though, due to some editing. Over all, very appealing.</td>', 'This is great! The turquoise and black is wonderful. I love the composition. I think the branches took on too much turquoise though, due to some editing. Over all, very appealing.', '2002-12-17 19:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(174527, 9824, 3575, '<td valign="top">Amazing beavers! Great photo too, what luck you found this.</td>', 'Amazing beavers! Great photo too, what luck you found this.', '2002-12-17 19:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(174529, 9663, 1202, '<td valign="top">IMO a sunset is no good without a foreground subject.   You have done a wonderful job of filling that need.   Keep up the good work.</td>', 'IMO a sunset is no good without a foreground subject.   You have done a wonderful job of filling that need.   Keep up the good work.', '2002-12-17 20:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(174530, 9758, 3575, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a wonderful montage. I love seeing the bird here feeding the babies. First of all, you found this wonderful seen to photograph and then you gave it to us like this! Each little frame has great DOF.  My only nit pick is the brown area at the top of each frame but this is still amazing considering you couldn''t do any cropping.</td>', 'Congratulations on a wonderful montage. I love seeing the bird here feeding the babies. First of all, you found this wonderful seen to photograph and then you gave it to us like this! Each little frame has great DOF.  My only nit pick is the brown area at the top of each frame but this is still amazing considering you couldn''t do any cropping.', '2002-12-17 20:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(174531, 9627, 3575, '<td valign="top">I love the light play  and the color of the sky. Very nice.</td>', 'I love the light play  and the color of the sky. Very nice.', '2002-12-17 20:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(174532, 9812, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderous find is right!  I can''t wait to hear the story behind it. :)</td>', 'Wonderous find is right!  I can''t wait to hear the story behind it. :)', '2002-12-17 20:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
