(174586, 9663, 1856, '<td valign="top">What a colorful sunset :)  I love the wheat (?) silhouttes.  I may have preferred that this had been shot from a tad higher...to show the gorgeous orange and golds more.</td>', 'What a colorful sunset :)  I love the wheat (?) silhouttes.  I may have preferred that this had been shot from a tad higher...to show the gorgeous orange and golds more.', '2002-12-17 22:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(174587, 9810, 1856, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Interesting composition and textures.  I love pushing colors in photos...but i think you may have gone a tad far with the blue here.  Maybe you could post the original after Sunday..I''d love to see the unaltered image :)</td>', 'I really like this.  Interesting composition and textures.  I love pushing colors in photos...but i think you may have gone a tad far with the blue here.  Maybe you could post the original after Sunday..I''d love to see the unaltered image :)', '2002-12-17 22:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(174588, 9753, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love the trees fading into the fog in the background...beautiful effect.  But (eek) the big tree in the foreground disturbs me...feels like it''s blocking my view of something incredible.</td>', 'I love the trees fading into the fog in the background...beautiful effect.  But (eek) the big tree in the foreground disturbs me...feels like it''s blocking my view of something incredible.', '2002-12-17 22:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(174590, 9758, 1856, '<td valign="top">This is so cool!  I can''t wait to see what kind of camera did this!  My one suggestion for improvement would be that you snap on a huge zoom lens so I can better see what the bird is doing :P</td>', 'This is so cool!  I can''t wait to see what kind of camera did this!  My one suggestion for improvement would be that you snap on a huge zoom lens so I can better see what the bird is doing :P', '2002-12-17 22:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(174593, 9614, 1856, '<td valign="top">Wow..this guy has little ears! LOL  Love his expression...nice dof on the background.  I think I might like a little more space for his ears and a little less at the bottom.  Nice work :)</td>', 'Wow..this guy has little ears! LOL  Love his expression...nice dof on the background.  I think I might like a little more space for his ears and a little less at the bottom.  Nice work :)', '2002-12-17 22:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(174594, 9757, 1856, '<td valign="top">What vivid colors on the bird!  I love his eye!  I think the one thing that really detracts from the impact of this photo is that both the bird and the background are quite busy.  I''d love to see him against a  more solid or less contrasty background.</td>', 'What vivid colors on the bird!  I love his eye!  I think the one thing that really detracts from the impact of this photo is that both the bird and the background are quite busy.  I''d love to see him against a  more solid or less contrasty background.', '2002-12-17 22:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(174595, 9789, 1856, '<td valign="top">Great composition..love the tufts on the cactus.  I''ve actually picked and eaten prickly pear...kinda good :)  I''d love to see this in color.</td>', 'Great composition..love the tufts on the cactus.  I''ve actually picked and eaten prickly pear...kinda good :)  I''d love to see this in color.', '2002-12-17 22:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(174612, 9661, 5700, '<td valign="top">Neat look</td>', 'Neat look', '2002-12-17 23:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(174642, 9729, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites this week.  I was wondering why the thumbnail image looked blurry, now I know.  Very interesting image, I am assuming you rotated the original 180 degrees.  I''m trying to find the start of the cows feet opposite the reflection, but I can''t find them! Nice color in the water.  Well done.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites this week.  I was wondering why the thumbnail image looked blurry, now I know.  Very interesting image, I am assuming you rotated the original 180 degrees.  I''m trying to find the start of the cows feet opposite the reflection, but I can''t find them! Nice color in the water.  Well done.', '2002-12-18 00:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(174645, 9677, 5475, '<td valign="top">I love cloud shots (in fact, my entry is a cloud shot this challenge).  I really like the composition here, and the moon in the center is a huge bonus, and actually ''makes'' the shot!  I see some red/purple/green/bluish artifacts in the midtones and in the blues of the sky.  This is a tough situation to get rid of, especially with the ''no spot-editing'' rule.  The best I have been able to do is desaturate the reds, greens, and magentas, and to lower the saturation on the yellows (not all the way).  I then run the despeckle filter, then an unsharp mask.  I believe this is all legal, and it''s the best combination I''ve come up with to clean up cloudscapes.  Nice shot and good luck! smellyfish1002</td>', 'I love cloud shots (in fact, my entry is a cloud shot this challenge).  I really like the composition here, and the moon in the center is a huge bonus, and actually ''makes'' the shot!  I see some red/purple/green/bluish artifacts in the midtones and in the blues of the sky.  This is a tough situation to get rid of, especially with the ''no spot-editing'' rule.  The best I have been able to do is desaturate the reds, greens, and magentas, and to lower the saturation on the yellows (not all the way).  I then run the despeckle filter, then an unsharp mask.  I believe this is all legal, and it''s the best combination I''ve come up with to clean up cloudscapes.  Nice shot and good luck! smellyfish1002', '2002-12-18 00:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(174647, 9661, 5475, '<td valign="top">I love this image, but I''m having a difficult time convincing myself that it meets the challenge.  Great idea and beautiful colors.</td>', 'I love this image, but I''m having a difficult time convincing myself that it meets the challenge.  Great idea and beautiful colors.', '2002-12-18 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(174652, 9821, 3280, '<td valign="top">The reflection that goes across the middle is very distracting. I can''t quite figure out what it is.  DPz</td>', 'The reflection that goes across the middle is very distracting. I can''t quite figure out what it is.  DPz', '2002-12-18 00:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
