(174824, 9783, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and choice of image size a lot on this one.  I may have been tempted to pan a little to the right to make the middle branch a little less centered, and include a bit more (or all) of the one on the right.  Still a great shot :)</td>', 'I like the colors and choice of image size a lot on this one.  I may have been tempted to pan a little to the right to make the middle branch a little less centered, and include a bit more (or all) of the one on the right.  Still a great shot :)', '2002-12-18 12:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
