(174828, 9755, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''ll be curious to hear how you pulled this one off... I''m guessing you may have taken some white poster board outside to use as a backdrop?  If you had taken the branch inside, it would have melted pretty quickly.  Or maybe you live in an igloo.  Whatever the case, I guess I''m trying to say, "Nice shot!"</td>', 'I''ll be curious to hear how you pulled this one off... I''m guessing you may have taken some white poster board outside to use as a backdrop?  If you had taken the branch inside, it would have melted pretty quickly.  Or maybe you live in an igloo.  Whatever the case, I guess I''m trying to say, "Nice shot!"', '2002-12-18 12:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(174829, 9819, 3102, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy these kinds of shots, where the water looks like silk.  I may have been tempted to leave the shutter open slightly longer, but that''s just me.  My only other comment would be that I think this would have been great had that one vertical tree been outta there.  Next time, take a saw along!  :)  Seriously, a very nice shot.</td>', 'I always enjoy these kinds of shots, where the water looks like silk.  I may have been tempted to leave the shutter open slightly longer, but that''s just me.  My only other comment would be that I think this would have been great had that one vertical tree been outta there.  Next time, take a saw along!  :)  Seriously, a very nice shot.', '2002-12-18 12:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(174831, 9681, 3102, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this a lot.  I think if I had to come up with a criticism, it would be that it may have been stronger had the branch been a little more "dramatic" with maybe a little bigger drop of dew, or something to make it stand out a bit more.  As it is, it seems like "just another branch" that happens to be in focus.  Still a nice shot :)</td>', 'Overall I like this a lot.  I think if I had to come up with a criticism, it would be that it may have been stronger had the branch been a little more "dramatic" with maybe a little bigger drop of dew, or something to make it stand out a bit more.  As it is, it seems like "just another branch" that happens to be in focus.  Still a nice shot :)', '2002-12-18 12:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(174832, 9746, 3102, '<td valign="top">Definitely a nicer-than-average shot of clouds!  Looks like you may have used a polarizing filter to bring them out against the sky, which is great.</td>', 'Definitely a nicer-than-average shot of clouds!  Looks like you may have used a polarizing filter to bring them out against the sky, which is great.', '2002-12-18 12:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(174833, 9643, 3102, '<td valign="top">Judging from some of the entries, someone must have gotten quite a nasty ice storm last week!  :)  I like this a lot -- the berries almost look like little eyeballs.</td>', 'Judging from some of the entries, someone must have gotten quite a nasty ice storm last week!  :)  I like this a lot -- the berries almost look like little eyeballs.', '2002-12-18 12:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
