(174840, 9627, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s an overall ok shot, but in all honesty it''s not one that has a lot of "zing" to it.  It just strikes me as being a reasonably typical view of a sky.</td>', 'It''s an overall ok shot, but in all honesty it''s not one that has a lot of "zing" to it.  It just strikes me as being a reasonably typical view of a sky.', '2002-12-18 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(174841, 9661, 3102, '<td valign="top">On one hand, it''s a unique image -- quite unique and abstract.  A part of me, though, says that ink is a byproduct of man, though.  Anal-retentively yours, asf :)</td>', 'On one hand, it''s a unique image -- quite unique and abstract.  A part of me, though, says that ink is a byproduct of man, though.  Anal-retentively yours, asf :)', '2002-12-18 13:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
