(174845, 9758, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can probably guess who did this since there was some discussion in the forums about this technique the other day... but I won''t hold that against you :)  Very cool effect... I guess my only wish would be that the bird would have done something more interesting than just "pecking around" -- it may have been more interesting if it had flown away during the last couple frames, but I have a feeling that would have been pretty darned hard to accomplish.</td>', 'I can probably guess who did this since there was some discussion in the forums about this technique the other day... but I won''t hold that against you :)  Very cool effect... I guess my only wish would be that the bird would have done something more interesting than just "pecking around" -- it may have been more interesting if it had flown away during the last couple frames, but I have a feeling that would have been pretty darned hard to accomplish.', '2002-12-18 13:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(174847, 9684, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nicely done -- good DOF and details in the nest!</td>', 'Nicely done -- good DOF and details in the nest!', '2002-12-18 13:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(174848, 9789, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice of toning... I''m not 100% sure whether I like it or not in all honesty.  What the heck, it''s Christmas, let''s just say I do like it :)  It''s nice &amp; sharp, and doesn''t look like something I''d want to touch.</td>', 'An interesting choice of toning... I''m not 100% sure whether I like it or not in all honesty.  What the heck, it''s Christmas, let''s just say I do like it :)  It''s nice & sharp, and doesn''t look like something I''d want to touch.', '2002-12-18 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
