(174862, 9714, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like this technique a lot, but it looks like you may have bumped the camera a little during the exposure... or something.  The rocks on the left seem a bit too blurred, to my eye.  Overall the image seems a little on the dark side.</td>', 'I like this technique a lot, but it looks like you may have bumped the camera a little during the exposure... or something.  The rocks on the left seem a bit too blurred, to my eye.  Overall the image seems a little on the dark side.', '2002-12-18 13:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(174863, 9815, 3102, '<td valign="top">Pleasant indeed :)  I like the reflection in the water.  Overall it looks just a hair too bright -- the snow on the bottom right seems just a little blown out to me.</td>', 'Pleasant indeed :)  I like the reflection in the water.  Overall it looks just a hair too bright -- the snow on the bottom right seems just a little blown out to me.', '2002-12-18 13:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(174865, 9711, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely an interesting shot, but there''s something that is keeping me from rating it among my highest.  It seems like it lacks a solid subject -- there''s no real focal point in the image... I guess that''s what''s bothering me.  It may have been more effective to focus in on one icycle and its surroundings...?</td>', 'It''s definitely an interesting shot, but there''s something that is keeping me from rating it among my highest.  It seems like it lacks a solid subject -- there''s no real focal point in the image... I guess that''s what''s bothering me.  It may have been more effective to focus in on one icycle and its surroundings...?', '2002-12-18 13:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(174869, 9812, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot overall, but it could have been a notch better if the center rock had been in sharper focus, I believe.</td>', 'An interesting shot overall, but it could have been a notch better if the center rock had been in sharper focus, I believe.', '2002-12-18 13:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(174871, 9752, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice use of tinting, and framing.  The sky seems a little too bright in parts, but overall a very pleasing image!</td>', 'Nice use of tinting, and framing.  The sky seems a little too bright in parts, but overall a very pleasing image!', '2002-12-18 13:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(174872, 9713, 3102, '<td valign="top">Let me know if you find any (intelligent life forms)!  An interesting composition/tint... I almost expect to see dudes playing harps in here somewhere.</td>', 'Let me know if you find any (intelligent life forms)!  An interesting composition/tint... I almost expect to see dudes playing harps in here somewhere.', '2002-12-18 13:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(174873, 9649, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting tint and composition.  In all honesty it seems like it''s missing some "punch" to me, though...</td>', 'An interesting tint and composition.  In all honesty it seems like it''s missing some "punch" to me, though...', '2002-12-18 13:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(174875, 9730, 3102, '<td valign="top">The bird could have been a little brighter, but a lot of folks say I''m not that bright either...</td>', 'The bird could have been a little brighter, but a lot of folks say I''m not that bright either...', '2002-12-18 13:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(174876, 9614, 3102, '<td valign="top">Poor thing looks like it''s being swarmed with flies!  A nice shot.</td>', 'Poor thing looks like it''s being swarmed with flies!  A nice shot.', '2002-12-18 13:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(174878, 9791, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not a bad composition... I guess there''s just not a lot here that gives it a lot of "zing" though :)</td>', 'Not a bad composition... I guess there''s just not a lot here that gives it a lot of "zing" though :)', '2002-12-18 13:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(174879, 9644, 3102, '<td valign="top">The anal retentive side of me wants to ask whether the hand of man chopped the antlers off and put them in front of a black background... but still an interesting shot :)</td>', 'The anal retentive side of me wants to ask whether the hand of man chopped the antlers off and put them in front of a black background... but still an interesting shot :)', '2002-12-18 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(174880, 9740, 3102, '<td valign="top">An ok composition, but lacking in "wow" factor a bit.</td>', 'An ok composition, but lacking in "wow" factor a bit.', '2002-12-18 13:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(174881, 9707, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but lacks a bit of "zing" for me.  Then again, my own shot doesn''t "zing" me either, so who am I to talk?</td>', 'Not bad, but lacks a bit of "zing" for me.  Then again, my own shot doesn''t "zing" me either, so who am I to talk?', '2002-12-18 13:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(174883, 9759, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not sure whether the purple tinting was intentional, but I probably would have preferred this in its natural form :)</td>', 'Not sure whether the purple tinting was intentional, but I probably would have preferred this in its natural form :)', '2002-12-18 13:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(174885, 9772, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seems a little oversharpened, but I like the subjects!  Might have been tempting to move in a little closer on just the purple leaf and a couple of the growths.</td>', 'Seems a little oversharpened, but I like the subjects!  Might have been tempting to move in a little closer on just the purple leaf and a couple of the growths.', '2002-12-18 13:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(174886, 9608, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the choice of DOF on this one... I probably would have gone for a deeper one.  An interesting subject, though :)</td>', 'Not sure about the choice of DOF on this one... I probably would have gone for a deeper one.  An interesting subject, though :)', '2002-12-18 13:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(174888, 9722, 3102, '<td valign="top">I might have featured the "stranded" little guy a little more prominently, and perhaps bring the background into sharper focus.</td>', 'I might have featured the "stranded" little guy a little more prominently, and perhaps bring the background into sharper focus.', '2002-12-18 13:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(174890, 9766, 3102, '<td valign="top">Blah blah blah rule of thirds blah blah blah.  I''m guessing you''re hearing some of that this week since the image is fairly divided in half in the top &amp; bottom.  It''s an interesting subject.  I might have considered cropping out the rock on the bottom right -- it seems just a little too dark compared to the rest of the features.</td>', 'Blah blah blah rule of thirds blah blah blah.  I''m guessing you''re hearing some of that this week since the image is fairly divided in half in the top & bottom.  It''s an interesting subject.  I might have considered cropping out the rock on the bottom right -- it seems just a little too dark compared to the rest of the features.', '2002-12-18 13:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(174891, 9781, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ouch - pointy!  Could be in a little better focus.  Hope you weren''t speared in the process of shooting this :)</td>', 'Ouch - pointy!  Could be in a little better focus.  Hope you weren''t speared in the process of shooting this :)', '2002-12-18 13:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(174892, 9654, 3102, '<td valign="top">Might have been better in full focus, rather than just a small part of the bark.  Or if the bottom third or so had been in focus anyway.  It just seems a little awkward to have a small portion of the middle in focus to my eye.</td>', 'Might have been better in full focus, rather than just a small part of the bark.  Or if the bottom third or so had been in focus anyway.  It just seems a little awkward to have a small portion of the middle in focus to my eye.', '2002-12-18 13:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(174893, 9721, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nice, crisp image.  Nice focus &amp; DOF.</td>', 'A nice, crisp image.  Nice focus & DOF.', '2002-12-18 13:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(174895, 9757, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cute bird - lovely colors!  Could have been a little sharper though, to my eye.</td>', 'Cute bird - lovely colors!  Could have been a little sharper though, to my eye.', '2002-12-18 13:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(174896, 9790, 3102, '<td valign="top">Is that a frog?  I didn''t even notice that outline until I had viewed it several times!</td>', 'Is that a frog?  I didn''t even notice that outline until I had viewed it several times!', '2002-12-18 13:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(174898, 9824, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like they''ve been busy!  :)  Nicely done.</td>', 'Looks like they''ve been busy!  :)  Nicely done.', '2002-12-18 13:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(174943, 9761, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge not met (according to my interpretation of the rules, no humans, or obvious signs of human presence should be visible).  sorry.  having got that out of the way, i still would like to critique your photo.  i just love the total look of faith and awe (you titled your photo well) on the little girls'' faces.  i also like your overall composition of only including santa partially.  another nice touch is the amount of reds and pinks in the photo, they kind of round the whole thing off.  a couple of things (not all of which are in your control) that i would''ve contemplated doing differently.  i don''t like santa''s hand position with the thumb sticking out much, did you get more shots (hoping he''s moving his hand), or did you try moving a little further to the left (if that was possible)?  that might also have included the third little girl more in the photo.  i would like to see the girls shoes, and i would also have cropped a bunch off the top of the photo (probably just above the head of the man behind the woman dressed in black).  the space above adds nothing to the photo and just distracts a little from your actual main subjects.  just my two cents.</td>', 'challenge not met (according to my interpretation of the rules, no humans, or obvious signs of human presence should be visible).  sorry.  having got that out of the way, i still would like to critique your photo.  i just love the total look of faith and awe (you titled your photo well) on the little girls'' faces.  i also like your overall composition of only including santa partially.  another nice touch is the amount of reds and pinks in the photo, they kind of round the whole thing off.  a couple of things (not all of which are in your control) that i would''ve contemplated doing differently.  i don''t like santa''s hand position with the thumb sticking out much, did you get more shots (hoping he''s moving his hand), or did you try moving a little further to the left (if that was possible)?  that might also have included the third little girl more in the photo.  i would like to see the girls shoes, and i would also have cropped a bunch off the top of the photo (probably just above the head of the man behind the woman dressed in black).  the space above adds nothing to the photo and just distracts a little from your actual main subjects.  just my two cents.', '2002-12-18 14:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(174947, 9608, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  the first thing i notice is kind of puzzling, while only a small part of the branch with lichen is in focus (narrow DOF, which, btw, i like here), the leaf on the right, which seems to be much closer to the camera also seems in focus.  hm.  illusion?  wasn''t that another challenge?  ;)  anyway.  as i already said, i like the shallow DOF.  the colors of the lichen are wonderful, and, while i''m usually a fan of simple plain backgrounds, the different colors of your background work very well.  they complement the color of the lichen, branch and leaves, but aren''t so recognizable that they distract.  i''m sitting here in front of my computer twisting my head from left to right wondering what the shot would look like if the branch didn''t run from left to right through it but at an angle ... did you try that out?  might not be better, i''m just curious.  overall, good shot.</td>', 'challenge met.  the first thing i notice is kind of puzzling, while only a small part of the branch with lichen is in focus (narrow DOF, which, btw, i like here), the leaf on the right, which seems to be much closer to the camera also seems in focus.  hm.  illusion?  wasn''t that another challenge?  ;)  anyway.  as i already said, i like the shallow DOF.  the colors of the lichen are wonderful, and, while i''m usually a fan of simple plain backgrounds, the different colors of your background work very well.  they complement the color of the lichen, branch and leaves, but aren''t so recognizable that they distract.  i''m sitting here in front of my computer twisting my head from left to right wondering what the shot would look like if the branch didn''t run from left to right through it but at an angle ... did you try that out?  might not be better, i''m just curious.  overall, good shot.', '2002-12-18 14:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(174953, 9681, 3080, '<td valign="top">The drop in the foreground is very nicely in focus.  The round white spots in the backgorund though distract in my opinioin.  They are too close to the shape of the drop, and some of them are quite near to the drop.  Otherwise, definately looks to be untouched by man.  The lighting on the subject its self is very nice, and the angle and framing/cropping are also good. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The drop in the foreground is very nicely in focus.  The round white spots in the backgorund though distract in my opinioin.  They are too close to the shape of the drop, and some of them are quite near to the drop.  Otherwise, definately looks to be untouched by man.  The lighting on the subject its self is very nice, and the angle and framing/cropping are also good. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 14:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(174954, 9810, 3080, '<td valign="top">The sky is a very pretty blue.  The rock though is strange to me. I am not so sure I like the very very dark shadow in the center of the photo.  There really isn''t anything to help us judge size on these either.  I know with nature objects, it''s often difficult to do that though.  The colors in the shot are nice.  Focus and clarity seem good too.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The sky is a very pretty blue.  The rock though is strange to me. I am not so sure I like the very very dark shadow in the center of the photo.  There really isn''t anything to help us judge size on these either.  I know with nature objects, it''s often difficult to do that though.  The colors in the shot are nice.  Focus and clarity seem good too.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 14:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(174955, 9614, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen for this.  The use of black and white is great here.  Focus and clarity are great as well.  The lighting for the most part is great, except for a small hot spot to the left of the photo.  A beautiful horse.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot.  I really like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen for this.  The use of black and white is great here.  Focus and clarity are great as well.  The lighting for the most part is great, except for a small hot spot to the left of the photo.  A beautiful horse.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 15:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(174976, 9681, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo, but I would like it even more if the subject of the single rain drop was a larger part of the overall image... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'I think this is a great photo, but I would like it even more if the subject of the single rain drop was a larger part of the overall image... nice work :) - setzler', '2002-12-18 16:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(174977, 9630, 772, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how this meets the challenge... - setzler</td>', 'I don''t understand how this meets the challenge... - setzler', '2002-12-18 16:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(174978, 9761, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT candid shot but I don''t understand how it ties into this challenge at all... - setzler</td>', 'This is a GREAT candid shot but I don''t understand how it ties into this challenge at all... - setzler', '2002-12-18 16:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(174980, 9644, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot overall, but I think it''s weak on the challenge theme.  The dark background makes me think the photo is contrived and not natural, therefore, the hand of man is at play in the photo? - setzler</td>', 'This is a nice shot overall, but I think it''s weak on the challenge theme.  The dark background makes me think the photo is contrived and not natural, therefore, the hand of man is at play in the photo? - setzler', '2002-12-18 16:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(175015, 9661, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot.  I''m not really seeing how this has no human intervention though.  I know this doesn''t occur naturally.  It is still very nice, and the color is great. Focus and clarity are perfect.  It is a very nice abstract indeed, but I don''t think it fits the challenge well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot.  I''m not really seeing how this has no human intervention though.  I know this doesn''t occur naturally.  It is still very nice, and the color is great. Focus and clarity are perfect.  It is a very nice abstract indeed, but I don''t think it fits the challenge well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 17:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(175024, 9768, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Definately naturally occuring.  i like the silhouetted trees against that sky.  What wonderful colors.  The angle and framing/cropping are great! I think the focus is a little soft, but don''t quote me on that , cause I''ve never really seen these trees before, so that might just be how they look.  Otherwise very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Definately naturally occuring.  i like the silhouetted trees against that sky.  What wonderful colors.  The angle and framing/cropping are great! I think the focus is a little soft, but don''t quote me on that , cause I''ve never really seen these trees before, so that might just be how they look.  Otherwise very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 17:43:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(175025, 9713, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!  Looks like a dream.  Definately looks untouched by man.  The tones are nice, and focus and clarity look good too.  I actually like the bright bright light at the top, I think it adds a lot to the overall photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful!!  Looks like a dream.  Definately looks untouched by man.  The tones are nice, and focus and clarity look good too.  I actually like the bright bright light at the top, I think it adds a lot to the overall photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 17:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(175037, 9744, 1856, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is quite possibly the best and most interesting composition I''ve seen for a ''creek shot.''  I love how it starts in upper right and runs out of the lower left corner!  Motion blur on the water is great too.  Fabulous work :) -12</td>', 'Wow!  This is quite possibly the best and most interesting composition I''ve seen for a ''creek shot.''  I love how it starts in upper right and runs out of the lower left corner!  Motion blur on the water is great too.  Fabulous work :) -12', '2002-12-18 18:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(175039, 9655, 2780, '<td valign="top">I liek this. I think it could do with being a bit darker, and maybe have a bit more contrast, but the it looks good anyway. I can''t help thinking it looks wonkey tho, leaning down on the left. Prolly just the uneven trees</td>', 'I liek this. I think it could do with being a bit darker, and maybe have a bit more contrast, but the it looks good anyway. I can''t help thinking it looks wonkey tho, leaning down on the left. Prolly just the uneven trees', '2002-12-18 18:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(175056, 9793, 2635, '<td valign="top">looks like something out of blair witch .. neat pic</td>', 'looks like something out of blair witch .. neat pic', '2002-12-18 19:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(175071, 9714, 3080, '<td valign="top">While I know that the water is suposed to have this effect, the focus on the surroundings appear to be in soft focus as well.  The very white spot just above half way up in the photo is a bit distracting.  I''m not sure what it is, but it kind of makes me want to concentrate on that one spot.  THe angle and framing/cropping seems good to me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'While I know that the water is suposed to have this effect, the focus on the surroundings appear to be in soft focus as well.  The very white spot just above half way up in the photo is a bit distracting.  I''m not sure what it is, but it kind of makes me want to concentrate on that one spot.  THe angle and framing/cropping seems good to me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 20:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(175072, 9677, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors.  The orange clouds are strange to me, but I''m not familiar with filters and such.  The little moon looks great.  The border is good for the photo.  I think the angle and framing/cropping are also good.  Having the mood in the center does not bother me here because it is actually a bit more to the top of the photo, and it''s ballenced by the clouds.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting colors.  The orange clouds are strange to me, but I''m not familiar with filters and such.  The little moon looks great.  The border is good for the photo.  I think the angle and framing/cropping are also good.  Having the mood in the center does not bother me here because it is actually a bit more to the top of the photo, and it''s ballenced by the clouds.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 20:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(175073, 9819, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what''s with all the milky water in this challenge, but I haven''t really decided if I like it as a whole.  You have used the technique well, and technically have done a good job, but I don''t think it appeals to me visually.  That''s just a personal opinion however, I know lots of people really like it.  This definately looks untouched by man, other than the effect of the water, but who''s counting.  Focus otherwise is nice, and the angle and framing/cropping is good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what''s with all the milky water in this challenge, but I haven''t really decided if I like it as a whole.  You have used the technique well, and technically have done a good job, but I don''t think it appeals to me visually.  That''s just a personal opinion however, I know lots of people really like it.  This definately looks untouched by man, other than the effect of the water, but who''s counting.  Focus otherwise is nice, and the angle and framing/cropping is good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 21:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(175074, 9793, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks really pixeled to me for some reason.  The use of black and white is a good choice, and I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen, with the trees off to the right side.  It just looks really square, with those "jaggies" (I think that''s what they are called)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks really pixeled to me for some reason.  The use of black and white is a good choice, and I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen, with the trees off to the right side.  It just looks really square, with those "jaggies" (I think that''s what they are called)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 21:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(175075, 9809, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus here seems to be just to the right of dead center on the little green branches.  I think I would like to see some of the berries in focus as well.  The color and lighting are both very good, and the angle and framing/cropping are ok too.  I would just prefer to have a bit more focus.  Just a personal preference. I have wondered what these look like.  I have friends, who are sisters, and their names are Jasmine, Jonquil and Juniper.  Never seen a Juniper before.  Thanks. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The focus here seems to be just to the right of dead center on the little green branches.  I think I would like to see some of the berries in focus as well.  The color and lighting are both very good, and the angle and framing/cropping are ok too.  I would just prefer to have a bit more focus.  Just a personal preference. I have wondered what these look like.  I have friends, who are sisters, and their names are Jasmine, Jonquil and Juniper.  Never seen a Juniper before.  Thanks. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 21:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(175076, 9784, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of grainy. LOL.  Just kidding.  I really like the composition though.  The contrast is great. I like the darkness against the light sand.  The angle and framing/cropping are just fine. I like how you have taken up the entire photo with the subject.  Definately looks untouched by man.  Nice find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of grainy. LOL.  Just kidding.  I really like the composition though.  The contrast is great. I like the darkness against the light sand.  The angle and framing/cropping are just fine. I like how you have taken up the entire photo with the subject.  Definately looks untouched by man.  Nice find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-18 21:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(175086, 9781, 5436, '<td valign="top">this looks way to sharp</td>', 'this looks way to sharp', '2002-12-18 21:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(175105, 9753, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and so well in focus.  I love how you have cropped it making a frame for the creek.  I''ll take your word that there is a creek down there.  I would love to see this in color also - there greenery coming thru the snow.  I''d give this an 8 easily.  PTL</td>', 'This is beautiful and so well in focus.  I love how you have cropped it making a frame for the creek.  I''ll take your word that there is a creek down there.  I would love to see this in color also - there greenery coming thru the snow.  I''d give this an 8 easily.  PTL', '2002-12-18 22:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(175107, 9663, 4648, '<td valign="top">That is a beautiful sky.  What are the plants?  they are so unique.  almost look like large wheat stalks.  They make the picture.  You usually get trees, but these are so different.  Good composition and well executed.  A 9 any time.  PTL</td>', 'That is a beautiful sky.  What are the plants?  they are so unique.  almost look like large wheat stalks.  They make the picture.  You usually get trees, but these are so different.  Good composition and well executed.  A 9 any time.  PTL', '2002-12-18 22:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(175109, 9649, 4648, '<td valign="top">The colorization ruinned this one.</td>', 'The colorization ruinned this one.', '2002-12-18 22:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(175110, 9729, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m not too sure about this one.  At first glance it looks like a totally out of focus cow.  At second look it looks like a reflection in the water without the cow to make the reflection.  And I''m sure it''s somewhere in between these two.  Which ever it is not appealling to me.  Just looks too much out of focus, except for the grass.  I''d have to give it a 3.</td>', 'I''m not too sure about this one.  At first glance it looks like a totally out of focus cow.  At second look it looks like a reflection in the water without the cow to make the reflection.  And I''m sure it''s somewhere in between these two.  Which ever it is not appealling to me.  Just looks too much out of focus, except for the grass.  I''d have to give it a 3.', '2002-12-18 22:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(175116, 9790, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject you''ve got here.  The contrast could be boosted a bit to bring out the form and relief I think.  I know this is a challenging image to capture and I like it...just wondering about that contrast. Nice job.</td>', 'Very interesting subject you''ve got here.  The contrast could be boosted a bit to bring out the form and relief I think.  I know this is a challenging image to capture and I like it...just wondering about that contrast. Nice job.', '2002-12-18 22:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(175117, 9636, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful patterns you captured, and well composed.  I also like the coloring.</td>', 'Beautiful patterns you captured, and well composed.  I also like the coloring.', '2002-12-18 22:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(175118, 9654, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good texture and interesting perspective.</td>', 'Good texture and interesting perspective.', '2002-12-18 22:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(175119, 9627, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty, soft, and good colors.</td>', 'Pretty, soft, and good colors.', '2002-12-18 22:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(175121, 9819, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, captured well.  Good exposure, dof,  and composition.</td>', 'Lovely scene, captured well.  Good exposure, dof,  and composition.', '2002-12-18 22:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(175122, 9772, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this fungus a lot but never have I seen such a purple leaf!  I love how the veins show.  I would actually like to see a close up of it, or the fungus.  They compete with each other for attention  To capture the detail on the leaf the fungus is a little over exposed in places.<br/>Overall nice.</td>', 'I''ve seen this fungus a lot but never have I seen such a purple leaf!  I love how the veins show.  I would actually like to see a close up of it, or the fungus.  They compete with each other for attention  To capture the detail on the leaf the fungus is a little over exposed in places.Overall nice.', '2002-12-18 23:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(175126, 9663, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and silhouettes.  Nicely composed. I like it. :-)</td>', 'Very nice colors and silhouettes.  Nicely composed. I like it. :-)', '2002-12-18 23:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(175127, 9590, 1280, '<td valign="top">You handled the white balance very well.  Interesting composition and texture.</td>', 'You handled the white balance very well.  Interesting composition and texture.', '2002-12-18 23:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(175130, 9676, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and texture.</td>', 'Interesting colors and texture.', '2002-12-18 23:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(175167, 9627, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately not by the hands of man, that''s for sure.  I like how you have filled the entire photo with the subject.  The focus and clarity are good, and colors are also very nice.  It is a technically well done shot.  It''s not overly exciting, but still good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately not by the hands of man, that''s for sure.  I like how you have filled the entire photo with the subject.  The focus and clarity are good, and colors are also very nice.  It is a technically well done shot.  It''s not overly exciting, but still good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(175168, 9752, 3080, '<td valign="top">There are a couple patches in the sky that seem just a TAD too bright.  Otherwise, I think this is a wonderful shot.  I like the sepia tones and the angle and framing/cropping are good.  No signs of man here.  The focus is nice, and lighting on the subject its self is good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There are a couple patches in the sky that seem just a TAD too bright.  Otherwise, I think this is a wonderful shot.  I like the sepia tones and the angle and framing/cropping are good.  No signs of man here.  The focus is nice, and lighting on the subject its self is good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(175171, 9753, 3080, '<td valign="top">Like a post card.  Very nice.  I really like how the snow coveres everything and makes the tree branches droop.  Normally, I''m not fond of the blown out white sky, but I think it works in this shot.  It''s a foggy kind of look, and I think it fits with the overall effect of the shot.  The angle and framing/cropping are really good.  Focus and clarity are great as well.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Like a post card.  Very nice.  I really like how the snow coveres everything and makes the tree branches droop.  Normally, I''m not fond of the blown out white sky, but I think it works in this shot.  It''s a foggy kind of look, and I think it fits with the overall effect of the shot.  The angle and framing/cropping are really good.  Focus and clarity are great as well.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(175172, 9729, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think it''s pretty cool that you took the photo of the reflection of the cow, rather than just taking a pic of the cow.  The angle and framing/cropping are really good.  Having some extra space in front of the cow really works.  the colors are great.  An interesting shot for sure.  Technically well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting.  I think it''s pretty cool that you took the photo of the reflection of the cow, rather than just taking a pic of the cow.  The angle and framing/cropping are really good.  Having some extra space in front of the cow really works.  the colors are great.  An interesting shot for sure.  Technically well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(175174, 9748, 3080, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit too dark for my personal tastes.  It''s just not very interesting to me.  The placement of the sun within the photo is good.  not having it dead center is a good thing in this case.  I just wish there were more to look at.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Quite a bit too dark for my personal tastes.  It''s just not very interesting to me.  The placement of the sun within the photo is good.  not having it dead center is a good thing in this case.  I just wish there were more to look at.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(175175, 9677, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, you did a great job of lighting the clouds. LOL  I''m not sure if the moon adds something here or not.  Good border for the shot as well. DPz</td>', 'Beautiful shot, you did a great job of lighting the clouds. LOL  I''m not sure if the moon adds something here or not.  Good border for the shot as well. DPz', '2002-12-19 00:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(175176, 9755, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, since I''m not so sure that that pure white background occured naturally, without any human intervention, I''m going to take a point off.  Feel free to let me know if I''m wrong, and I''ll fix it.  Otherwise, the photo is excelent.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  I LOVE the focus and clarity on the ice.  The way we can see the stick through the ice is very nice as well.  Lighting is perfect.  Great job! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, since I''m not so sure that that pure white background occured naturally, without any human intervention, I''m going to take a point off.  Feel free to let me know if I''m wrong, and I''ll fix it.  Otherwise, the photo is excelent.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  I LOVE the focus and clarity on the ice.  The way we can see the stick through the ice is very nice as well.  Lighting is perfect.  Great job! Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(175177, 9721, 3280, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one without a vote. I like the flowers and yet something about it sets wrong with me.  I think it is the falleng petals on the leaf in the bottom right.  Good shot anyway. DPz</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one without a vote. I like the flowers and yet something about it sets wrong with me.  I think it is the falleng petals on the leaf in the bottom right.  Good shot anyway. DPz', '2002-12-19 00:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(175178, 9774, 3280, '<td valign="top">Certainly blends in .  Good composition but you may have wanted to crop or de-saturate the green at the top.  DPz</td>', 'Certainly blends in .  Good composition but you may have wanted to crop or de-saturate the green at the top.  DPz', '2002-12-19 00:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(175179, 9766, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I feel this may have worked better with an overcast sky or in B &amp; W. DPz</td>', 'Good shot.  I feel this may have worked better with an overcast sky or in B & W. DPz', '2002-12-19 00:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(175180, 9740, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good color and clarity.  Not sure I see the Sunset here though. I like the shot.  DPz</td>', 'Good color and clarity.  Not sure I see the Sunset here though. I like the shot.  DPz', '2002-12-19 00:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(175181, 9759, 3080, '<td valign="top">a couple blown out bright spots, but your focus and clarity are really good.  I like the slightly blurred background.  it helps to draw attention to the textures on the log.  The fungus(?) is interesting.  I found myself looking at it trying to figure out exactly what it is.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  I also like the patterns of the sticks in the upper right corner.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'a couple blown out bright spots, but your focus and clarity are really good.  I like the slightly blurred background.  it helps to draw attention to the textures on the log.  The fungus(?) is interesting.  I found myself looking at it trying to figure out exactly what it is.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  I also like the patterns of the sticks in the upper right corner.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(175182, 9608, 3080, '<td valign="top">What excelent DOF.  I ususally like the dof to be a bit larger than this, but I think it''s excelent.  You bring out the texture in all the right places, and the color and lighting is very nice.  background is not distracting at all.  Angle and framing/cropping are great. You really create some depth here.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What excelent DOF.  I ususally like the dof to be a bit larger than this, but I think it''s excelent.  You bring out the texture in all the right places, and the color and lighting is very nice.  background is not distracting at all.  Angle and framing/cropping are great. You really create some depth here.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(175183, 9783, 3080, '<td valign="top">While there isn''t really much to look at, it''s really pretty!!  The focus and clarity on the leaves are great.  simple but beautiful.  appears to have no human intervention.  lovely colors, great framing/cropping.  I like this a lot.  Great find.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'While there isn''t really much to look at, it''s really pretty!!  The focus and clarity on the leaves are great.  simple but beautiful.  appears to have no human intervention.  lovely colors, great framing/cropping.  I like this a lot.  Great find.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(175184, 9729, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is such an awesome shot.  I actually had to take it to my PSP and flip it to see the reflection right.  The blue is perfect, everything looks like a painting.  I''m not positive a Cow fits the challenge but the shot overcomes it anyway.  Fantastic job!  DPz</td>', 'This is such an awesome shot.  I actually had to take it to my PSP and flip it to see the reflection right.  The blue is perfect, everything looks like a painting.  I''m not positive a Cow fits the challenge but the shot overcomes it anyway.  Fantastic job!  DPz', '2002-12-19 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(175185, 9746, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. DPz</td>', 'Very nice shot. DPz', '2002-12-19 00:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(175186, 9696, 3080, '<td valign="top">There just isn''t enough in this shot to really hold my attention long.  The color is ok, but it needs something else to really sing to me.  The focus and clarity are nice.  Definately appears to fit the challenge, and it''s a good idea, just a bit plain for my own personal tastes.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There just isn''t enough in this shot to really hold my attention long.  The color is ok, but it needs something else to really sing to me.  The focus and clarity are nice.  Definately appears to fit the challenge, and it''s a good idea, just a bit plain for my own personal tastes.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(175187, 9790, 3280, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I look and look at this and can''t really tell what I''m looking at.  DPz</td>', 'I''m sorry, I look and look at this and can''t really tell what I''m looking at.  DPz', '2002-12-19 00:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(175188, 9783, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity and color and I really like the orientation.  Only nit is I feel the leaves on the right is a distraction the way they are cropped.  Good job. DPz</td>', 'Beautiful clarity and color and I really like the orientation.  Only nit is I feel the leaves on the right is a distraction the way they are cropped.  Good job. DPz', '2002-12-19 00:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(175189, 9757, 3080, '<td valign="top">With the exception of a few blown out bright spots, this is a very nice shot.  I like the colors.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  There is a bright spot on the wood in the bottom right, on his back by his "shoulder" and on top of his head.  The one on his beak doesn''t bother me at all.  The background is a bit distracting with the white circle shapes.  Otherwise, very pretty bird.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'With the exception of a few blown out bright spots, this is a very nice shot.  I like the colors.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  There is a bright spot on the wood in the bottom right, on his back by his "shoulder" and on top of his head.  The one on his beak doesn''t bother me at all.  The background is a bit distracting with the white circle shapes.  Otherwise, very pretty bird.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 00:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(175190, 9753, 3280, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting, very nice.  DPz</td>', 'Looks like a painting, very nice.  DPz', '2002-12-19 00:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(175191, 9790, 3080, '<td valign="top">poor froggy.  Definately looks untouched by man.  Not a overly exciting shot, but I think it has some photojournalistic, or documentary aspcets.  the lighting on the subject appears good, I wonder if the lighting was a bit harsher if there would be some shadow to help bring out the shape?  maybe like a side light or something.  Something to try at least.  Great find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'poor froggy.  Definately looks untouched by man.  Not a overly exciting shot, but I think it has some photojournalistic, or documentary aspcets.  the lighting on the subject appears good, I wonder if the lighting was a bit harsher if there would be some shadow to help bring out the shape?  maybe like a side light or something.  Something to try at least.  Great find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 01:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(175192, 9740, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination of blues.  The silhouetted tree int he front works very nicely.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  The focus and clarity are good as well.  Definately looks untouched by man.  I really like the mixture of blues though.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting combination of blues.  The silhouetted tree int he front works very nicely.  The angle and framing/cropping are great.  The focus and clarity are good as well.  Definately looks untouched by man.  I really like the mixture of blues though.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 01:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(175193, 9791, 3080, '<td valign="top">The blue shot just like this, and this one were right together for me.  The silhouette is nice, and the focus and clarity are good as well.  Lighting is nice, but I think that the bright spot might be just a tad too bright for my personal tastes.  Overall a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The blue shot just like this, and this one were right together for me.  The silhouette is nice, and the focus and clarity are good as well.  Lighting is nice, but I think that the bright spot might be just a tad too bright for my personal tastes.  Overall a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 01:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(175196, 9700, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!!  What great focus and clarity.  The angle and framing/cropping is wonderful.  I love the placement of the cone within the frame.  The colors are great, and the lighting is just perfect for this shot.  I really have nothing to complain about. (miracle, huh?)  Great find!!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty!!  What great focus and clarity.  The angle and framing/cropping is wonderful.  I love the placement of the cone within the frame.  The colors are great, and the lighting is just perfect for this shot.  I really have nothing to complain about. (miracle, huh?)  Great find!!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 01:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
