(175230, 9663, 3540, '<td valign="top">Almost.  Looks like it would''ve been a little better off a little earlier.  Also there''s  a little too much tall stuff blocking the view. - Inspzil</td>', 'Almost.  Looks like it would''ve been a little better off a little earlier.  Also there''s  a little too much tall stuff blocking the view. - Inspzil', '2002-12-19 06:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
