(175388, 9636, 3080, '<td valign="top">THis is great.  I really like the angle that the trees come together inthe middle.  The sepia tones work nicely, and it definately appears to be untouched by man.  Your focus and clarity are really nice, and the lighting conditions appear to have been cooperative for you.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'THis is great.  I really like the angle that the trees come together inthe middle.  The sepia tones work nicely, and it definately appears to be untouched by man.  Your focus and clarity are really nice, and the lighting conditions appear to have been cooperative for you.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(175391, 9815, 3080, '<td valign="top">This kind of all runs together.  I wish we had something that stood out.  I''m not saying it''s a bad pic, I like it.  I think it looks a bit abstract though.  It would definately be a veyr hard puzzle to put together.  The black and white is ok.  I would like to see the color for comparisson though.Definately looks untouched by man.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This kind of all runs together.  I wish we had something that stood out.  I''m not saying it''s a bad pic, I like it.  I think it looks a bit abstract though.  It would definately be a veyr hard puzzle to put together.  The black and white is ok.  I would like to see the color for comparisson though.Definately looks untouched by man.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 15:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(175392, 9781, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks good to me.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like the downward angle of the ice cicles.  focus and clarity are good.  The contrast appears to be alright as well.  Lighting conditions appear to have been cooperative for you.  Looks untouched by man to me, although I can''t really tell what the cicles are hanging off of, that''s ok.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks good to me.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like the downward angle of the ice cicles.  focus and clarity are good.  The contrast appears to be alright as well.  Lighting conditions appear to have been cooperative for you.  Looks untouched by man to me, although I can''t really tell what the cicles are hanging off of, that''s ok.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(175394, 9590, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excelent focus and clarity.  I really like how it''s all white except the leaf.  The small splash of color is very nice.  I like the placement of the leaf within the photo.  I like the composition very much.  Lighting conditions are just perfect.  Great find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Excelent focus and clarity.  I really like how it''s all white except the leaf.  The small splash of color is very nice.  I like the placement of the leaf within the photo.  I like the composition very much.  Lighting conditions are just perfect.  Great find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 15:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(175398, 9777, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks untouched by man to me.  Good find.  The angle and framing/cropping appear good.  The sky is nice.  I like how it''s a beautiful blue at the top and fades down to pinkish orange.I wonder how it would look if the silhouettes were just a bit darker.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks untouched by man to me.  Good find.  The angle and framing/cropping appear good.  The sky is nice.  I like how it''s a beautiful blue at the top and fades down to pinkish orange.I wonder how it would look if the silhouettes were just a bit darker.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 15:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(175399, 9772, 3080, '<td valign="top">This appears kind of grainy to me.  Overall a nice shot though.  The bright yellow leaf really stands out and draws in ones attention.  The little flowers are cute, and the fungus makes an interesting pattern. Looks untouched by man to me, but too grainy for my personal tastes.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This appears kind of grainy to me.  Overall a nice shot though.  The bright yellow leaf really stands out and draws in ones attention.  The little flowers are cute, and the fungus makes an interesting pattern. Looks untouched by man to me, but too grainy for my personal tastes.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-19 15:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(175400, 9783, 2737, '<td valign="top">Love the warm colored background and crisp black foreground.  Excellent!</td>', 'Love the warm colored background and crisp black foreground.  Excellent!', '2002-12-19 15:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(175401, 9654, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting with the high-key foreground and flatter background.</td>', 'Interesting lighting with the high-key foreground and flatter background.', '2002-12-19 15:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(175405, 9746, 1031, '<td valign="top">I might have titled this to emphasize the unusual rectangular opening at the bottom.</td>', 'I might have titled this to emphasize the unusual rectangular opening at the bottom.', '2002-12-19 15:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(175411, 9714, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think this would look better if it were brightened up just a little. Ilike the composition with the falls crossing the frame diagonally.</td>', 'I think this would look better if it were brightened up just a little. Ilike the composition with the falls crossing the frame diagonally.', '2002-12-19 15:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(175417, 9758, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think it''s interesting to see the sequence, but it does make it difficult to appreciate the detail in any of the images. This effect would probably be best suited to an action sequence where the motion itself ismore important than the subject, like a pelican diving into the water, or the classic galloping horse.</td>', 'I think it''s interesting to see the sequence, but it does make it difficult to appreciate the detail in any of the images. This effect would probably be best suited to an action sequence where the motion itself ismore important than the subject, like a pelican diving into the water, or the classic galloping horse.', '2002-12-19 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(175419, 9753, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like a classic greeting card shot. I wish the tips of te first 3 trees on the left were just a tad darker and more distinct, but the rest of the trees fade perfectly. Would also look great run through a "painting" filter.<br/>This is apparently not the same Rocky Creek where I''ve taken some photos...</td>', 'Looks like a classic greeting card shot. I wish the tips of te first 3 trees on the left were just a tad darker and more distinct, but the rest of the trees fade perfectly. Would also look great run through a "painting" filter.This is apparently not the same Rocky Creek where I''ve taken some photos...', '2002-12-19 15:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(175421, 9655, 1031, '<td valign="top">To make it even more spooky I''d have tried to darken the sky (and maybe lighted the nearest foreground) while keeping the woods about as they are. Think I''ll take a flashlight...</td>', 'To make it even more spooky I''d have tried to darken the sky (and maybe lighted the nearest foreground) while keeping the woods about as they are. Think I''ll take a flashlight...', '2002-12-19 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(175423, 9783, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job here using the sunset as an abstact background instead of the subject. Good focus on the silhouettes (and not oversharpened) and  like the way you''ve fit thm to the cloud shapes.</td>', 'Nice job here using the sunset as an abstact background instead of the subject. Good focus on the silhouettes (and not oversharpened) and  like the way you''ve fit thm to the cloud shapes.', '2002-12-19 15:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
