(175448, 9730, 1280, '<td valign="top">A Cormorant?  Wonderful silhouette and beautifully colored sky. Very appealing composition too.  I don''t see a thing I''d change.  Nice job!<br/>I''m back to say this is my highest rated of the challenge.  9</td>', 'A Cormorant?  Wonderful silhouette and beautifully colored sky. Very appealing composition too.  I don''t see a thing I''d change.  Nice job!I''m back to say this is my highest rated of the challenge.  9', '2002-12-19 16:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
