(175451, 9661, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good concept shot.  I think this image may get misunderstood.  I like it very much.  <br/>I''m back to bump you up to 9. One of my two 9''s...the highest I''ve rated for this challenge.</td>', 'Very good concept shot.  I think this image may get misunderstood.  I like it very much.  I''m back to bump you up to 9. One of my two 9''s...the highest I''ve rated for this challenge.', '2002-12-19 16:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(175455, 9761, 2490, '<td valign="top">I confess I''m stupid and confused about this photo and the challenge relevance.  I''m really trying hard to give you the benefit of the doubt but I''m not sure how to connect it, so I''m not sure how to vote.</td>', 'I confess I''m stupid and confused about this photo and the challenge relevance.  I''m really trying hard to give you the benefit of the doubt but I''m not sure how to connect it, so I''m not sure how to vote.', '2002-12-19 16:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(175458, 9758, 2490, '<td valign="top">I almost voted this a 3 because I would personally like to discourage this type of "effects in the camera" usage on DPC.  However, you tell a great story and did a good job of photography, so I won''t punish you like that :-)  The more I look the more I like it.  7 nards656</td>', 'I almost voted this a 3 because I would personally like to discourage this type of "effects in the camera" usage on DPC.  However, you tell a great story and did a good job of photography, so I won''t punish you like that :-)  The more I look the more I like it.  7 nards656', '2002-12-19 16:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(175461, 9748, 2983, '<td valign="top">Dark and ominous, a pretty nice picture</td>', 'Dark and ominous, a pretty nice picture', '2002-12-19 16:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(175462, 9752, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good border color. 8</td>', 'Good border color. 8', '2002-12-19 16:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(175463, 9824, 2490, '<td valign="top">I hate to say this, but for once, maybe TOO much depth of field?  A little OOF in the background would have really set off and outlined the tree.</td>', 'I hate to say this, but for once, maybe TOO much depth of field?  A little OOF in the background would have really set off and outlined the tree.', '2002-12-19 16:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
