(175493, 9661, 3320, '<td valign="top">aahhhhhh I am torn .. I like the picture a lot ... but I keep seeing somebody mixing the colors in water or something to get that .. I cannot get the ''man'' our of it in my head ... So I am giving it a 7 but would probably have give it momre in an other challenge. Very nice ''art'' painting/photography. Lionel</td>', 'aahhhhhh I am torn .. I like the picture a lot ... but I keep seeing somebody mixing the colors in water or something to get that .. I cannot get the ''man'' our of it in my head ... So I am giving it a 7 but would probably have give it momre in an other challenge. Very nice ''art'' painting/photography. Lionel', '2002-12-19 19:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(175538, 9684, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think some of the bottom of the photo could have been cropped.  Still a nice photo with a great title.</td>', 'I think some of the bottom of the photo could have been cropped.  Still a nice photo with a great title.', '2002-12-19 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(175555, 9663, 5318, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT PHOTO LPDOLL   THAT SURE IS A AWSOME SUNSET    VERY NICE!!!!<br/></td>', 'EXCELLENT PHOTO LPDOLL   THAT SURE IS A AWSOME SUNSET    VERY NICE!!!!', '2002-12-19 23:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(175588, 9643, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Very natural (fits the challenge) Love the DOF!  Excellent composition!  Great colors, overall a very appealing nice photo!  I love it!  Great job and good luck!  - 10</td>', 'Beautiful.  Very natural (fits the challenge) Love the DOF!  Excellent composition!  Great colors, overall a very appealing nice photo!  I love it!  Great job and good luck!  - 10', '2002-12-20 02:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(175589, 9768, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes and interesting composition. The colours of the sky are vivid, but something about the way you''ve framed this makes it feel a bit flat, to me. I don''t thinke the negative space quite works the way it should. It makes the trees feel like an afterthought, rather than being an intentional element.<br/> <br/>I''d love to see some experiments with different crops!</td>', 'Nice silhouettes and interesting composition. The colours of the sky are vivid, but something about the way you''ve framed this makes it feel a bit flat, to me. I don''t thinke the negative space quite works the way it should. It makes the trees feel like an afterthought, rather than being an intentional element. I''d love to see some experiments with different crops!', '2002-12-20 02:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(175591, 9722, 1037, '<td valign="top">I can see what I''m supposed to see, but only with a bit of work. That''s nice in that it makes the most of the contemplative, serene nature of the surroundings, but I think the marriage of title and image doesn''t quite work. More visual emphasis on the little plant would have made the title more direct. Placing it in an area where third lines intersect may have worked to draw more attention to it, or perhaps desaturating the photo slightly and boosting the red channel? Good work though.<br/> <br/>There, I just tried my own suggestions: //lisa3d.org/images/photos/dpc/stranded2.jpg</td>', 'I can see what I''m supposed to see, but only with a bit of work. That''s nice in that it makes the most of the contemplative, serene nature of the surroundings, but I think the marriage of title and image doesn''t quite work. More visual emphasis on the little plant would have made the title more direct. Placing it in an area where third lines intersect may have worked to draw more attention to it, or perhaps desaturating the photo slightly and boosting the red channel? Good work though. There, I just tried my own suggestions: //lisa3d.org/images/photos/dpc/stranded2.jpg', '2002-12-20 02:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(175592, 9711, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cool! I don''t know where you''re from, so you might not understand this, but this photo brings back really vivid memories of old "Dr. Who" episodes :).<br/> <br/>I love all the weird shapes and textures in here. But I think maybe it would have been more effective if you cropped it a bit more tightly. It''s just a bit busy, and parts are overexposed, for no good reason that I can see. Nice idea though.</td>', 'Cool! I don''t know where you''re from, so you might not understand this, but this photo brings back really vivid memories of old "Dr. Who" episodes :). I love all the weird shapes and textures in here. But I think maybe it would have been more effective if you cropped it a bit more tightly. It''s just a bit busy, and parts are overexposed, for no good reason that I can see. Nice idea though.', '2002-12-20 02:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(175593, 9820, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the blur of the water and the soft, pastel green of the lichen. The composition around the rocks is very nice. I think, though, that I would have tried some photos from a lower camera angle to get a more interesting perspective on the rocks. There is little depth in this photo, so it looks a bit flat.</td>', 'I like the blur of the water and the soft, pastel green of the lichen. The composition around the rocks is very nice. I think, though, that I would have tried some photos from a lower camera angle to get a more interesting perspective on the rocks. There is little depth in this photo, so it looks a bit flat.', '2002-12-20 02:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(175602, 9696, 1031, '<td valign="top">This looks a little over-sharpened to me -- especially easy to do with silhouettes. It''s also a preference; I know a lot of people like more sharpening than I do...</td>', 'This looks a little over-sharpened to me -- especially easy to do with silhouettes. It''s also a preference; I know a lot of people like more sharpening than I do...', '2002-12-20 04:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(175603, 9740, 1031, '<td valign="top">Bottom part looks over-sharpened a little, but I kno I prefer less than a lot of people. I like the color and texture of the background (not your typical sunset photo) and the tree fits well.</td>', 'Bottom part looks over-sharpened a little, but I kno I prefer less than a lot of people. I like the color and texture of the background (not your typical sunset photo) and the tree fits well.', '2002-12-20 04:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(175621, 9753, 1037, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful! I especially love the mist in the distance... so atmospheric. It''s just perfect. I can''t fault it, and I love looking at it. I have to give it 10.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful! I especially love the mist in the distance... so atmospheric. It''s just perfect. I can''t fault it, and I love looking at it. I have to give it 10.', '2002-12-20 05:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(175622, 9721, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous flower photo. The composition is tight, the DOF brings my attention right to those two flower heads. The background of leaves is lovely. Very nice work.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous flower photo. The composition is tight, the DOF brings my attention right to those two flower heads. The background of leaves is lovely. Very nice work.', '2002-12-20 05:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(175623, 9614, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. It looks like a rugged, northern European type of pony. I love that shaggy hair. The black and white could be a touch more contrasty, otherwise, the framing, focus and exposure are all very good.</td>', 'Very pretty. It looks like a rugged, northern European type of pony. I love that shaggy hair. The black and white could be a touch more contrasty, otherwise, the framing, focus and exposure are all very good.', '2002-12-20 05:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(175624, 9714, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really LOVE the action in this photo. That''s some powerful water.<br/> <br/>However, there are a few issues. It seems like you didn''t use a tripod for this long exposure shot. Also, it''s a bit underexposed. You could fix it pretty well with post processing though, just play with the levels a bit. That''s all though, the composition is really nice and the water makes this photo exciting.</td>', 'I really LOVE the action in this photo. That''s some powerful water. However, there are a few issues. It seems like you didn''t use a tripod for this long exposure shot. Also, it''s a bit underexposed. You could fix it pretty well with post processing though, just play with the levels a bit. That''s all though, the composition is really nice and the water makes this photo exciting.', '2002-12-20 05:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(175625, 9703, 1037, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition, and the colours here are pleasant. Seems like the snow is a bit overexposed, and the image quality is low (both signs of a low end camera, probably, so I don''t mind). Nice work, overall.</td>', 'Really nice composition, and the colours here are pleasant. Seems like the snow is a bit overexposed, and the image quality is low (both signs of a low end camera, probably, so I don''t mind). Nice work, overall.', '2002-12-20 05:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(175626, 9661, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, but I think the thick black border is a bit overbearing. Perhaps a bit more white space around the ink swirls would help to increase their impact as well. Good idea though, I love all the colour and turbulance.</td>', 'This is really nice, but I think the thick black border is a bit overbearing. Perhaps a bit more white space around the ink swirls would help to increase their impact as well. Good idea though, I love all the colour and turbulance.', '2002-12-20 05:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(175627, 9676, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool location. I love the steam and the red.. stuff on the side (it can''t be lava, can it?).  It''s a weird, alien landscape, nicely framed. The light seems a tad harsh, and maybe you could have cropped it more, because those rocks in the foreground are a little bit busy. Nice work though.</td>', 'Very cool location. I love the steam and the red.. stuff on the side (it can''t be lava, can it?).  It''s a weird, alien landscape, nicely framed. The light seems a tad harsh, and maybe you could have cropped it more, because those rocks in the foreground are a little bit busy. Nice work though.', '2002-12-20 05:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(175628, 9746, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the diagonal formation of the clouds, and their increasing darkness towards the lower right corner. I feel like the colours are a bit muted, but that may work better in this photo than a really bright blue sky. I like it a lot, nonetheless.</td>', 'Very nice. I love the diagonal formation of the clouds, and their increasing darkness towards the lower right corner. I feel like the colours are a bit muted, but that may work better in this photo than a really bright blue sky. I like it a lot, nonetheless.', '2002-12-20 05:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(175629, 9680, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, but I think the composition is a bit off. That leaf on the top left leads my eyes out of the photo, and draws attention from the little berry. I actually think flipping it horizontally, at the very least, would strengthen this photo. Try it!<br/> <br/>Nice colours though, and I really like the way the light filters  through the ice around the edges of everything.</td>', 'This is interesting, but I think the composition is a bit off. That leaf on the top left leads my eyes out of the photo, and draws attention from the little berry. I actually think flipping it horizontally, at the very least, would strengthen this photo. Try it! Nice colours though, and I really like the way the light filters  through the ice around the edges of everything.', '2002-12-20 06:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(175631, 9789, 1037, '<td valign="top">Fairly nice composition, but the contrast is a bit too low. The photo seems washed out, with very harsh sunlight. Obviously, in the kinds of climates you find prickly pears growing, you will have strong sunlight to deal with, but photographing the subject in the dawn or dusk light would help this a bit. The shadows make this look like late afternoon or mid morning, times when the light will still be harsh.</td>', 'Fairly nice composition, but the contrast is a bit too low. The photo seems washed out, with very harsh sunlight. Obviously, in the kinds of climates you find prickly pears growing, you will have strong sunlight to deal with, but photographing the subject in the dawn or dusk light would help this a bit. The shadows make this look like late afternoon or mid morning, times when the light will still be harsh.', '2002-12-20 06:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(175632, 9681, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the shallow DOF here, and the lovely sweeping composition of the twigs. That dappled light in the background is lovely. Very atmospheric.</td>', 'I love the shallow DOF here, and the lovely sweeping composition of the twigs. That dappled light in the background is lovely. Very atmospheric.', '2002-12-20 06:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(175634, 9812, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting... however, I think this photo has a lot of problems. The light is too hard, and flares off the water drops. It would be good to diffuse it and bounce it off something (white card, etc.) to fill the shadows. The colours are a bit muddy. It would be nice to try underexposing it a bit and boosting those colours in post processing. The composition seems a bit flat and chaotic. A closer crop, etc. would be good to try. And lastly, it seems as though the focus is on some of the background rocks, leaving the foreground object a bit blurred. <br/> <br/>I think this is a neat idea that could be really cool if you tried it again with improved lighting and played with it in post processing.</td>', 'Interesting... however, I think this photo has a lot of problems. The light is too hard, and flares off the water drops. It would be good to diffuse it and bounce it off something (white card, etc.) to fill the shadows. The colours are a bit muddy. It would be nice to try underexposing it a bit and boosting those colours in post processing. The composition seems a bit flat and chaotic. A closer crop, etc. would be good to try. And lastly, it seems as though the focus is on some of the background rocks, leaving the foreground object a bit blurred.  I think this is a neat idea that could be really cool if you tried it again with improved lighting and played with it in post processing.', '2002-12-20 06:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(175701, 9809, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The berries all seem to explode from a central point. The colours are also very rich. DOF is just right to distinguish this bunch of berries from its background. A very good photo.</td>', 'Great composition. The berries all seem to explode from a central point. The colours are also very rich. DOF is just right to distinguish this bunch of berries from its background. A very good photo.', '2002-12-20 09:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(175702, 9684, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the framing of this. It makes me feel like I''m high up in a tree, in a cramped place. The colours and shapes of the twigs are really nice. You''ve thought a lot about the challenge topic too. It shoes a lot more insight than a lot of the photos, which don''t really feature things that were "made" by anyone (unless you''re religious). One of my 10s.</td>', 'I love the framing of this. It makes me feel like I''m high up in a tree, in a cramped place. The colours and shapes of the twigs are really nice. You''ve thought a lot about the challenge topic too. It shoes a lot more insight than a lot of the photos, which don''t really feature things that were "made" by anyone (unless you''re religious). One of my 10s.', '2002-12-20 09:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(175704, 9757, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this. It seems a little bit overexposed in places, but I don''t mind. It adds to the brilliance of the overall effect here. Great framing and nice DOF too.</td>', 'I love the colours in this. It seems a little bit overexposed in places, but I don''t mind. It adds to the brilliance of the overall effect here. Great framing and nice DOF too.', '2002-12-20 09:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(175705, 9655, 1037, '<td valign="top">Kind of an atmospheric photo, but the composition is flat. The two trees together compete for attention. I love the effect of the branches against the sky, but the grass in the foreground is dull and doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'Kind of an atmospheric photo, but the composition is flat. The two trees together compete for attention. I love the effect of the branches against the sky, but the grass in the foreground is dull and doesn''t add anything.', '2002-12-20 09:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(175706, 9608, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty, in a weird kind of way :). I like your shallow DOF effect. Interestingly, this photo didn''t strike me straight away, but the more I look at it, the more I like it! The textures are amazing, and the lighting is soft and even. Very nice work.</td>', 'Pretty, in a weird kind of way :). I like your shallow DOF effect. Interestingly, this photo didn''t strike me straight away, but the more I look at it, the more I like it! The textures are amazing, and the lighting is soft and even. Very nice work.', '2002-12-20 09:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(175709, 9649, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I like this, it''s cool. However, it needs some tonal depth. The darkest tones are too light. It''s easy to do that, just adjust the levels in photoshop, or your favourite processing software. Even brightness/contrast will do it. If it doesn''t look too light to you, it may be your monitor. Check the squares along the bottom of the voting pages to see how many you can distinguish.</td>', 'Hmm... I like this, it''s cool. However, it needs some tonal depth. The darkest tones are too light. It''s easy to do that, just adjust the levels in photoshop, or your favourite processing software. Even brightness/contrast will do it. If it doesn''t look too light to you, it may be your monitor. Check the squares along the bottom of the voting pages to see how many you can distinguish.', '2002-12-20 09:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(175711, 9707, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this, and the gnarled, silhouetted shape of the tree. The central composition works here. It may be a little bit underexposed, but nonetheless a nice photo.</td>', 'I love the colours in this, and the gnarled, silhouetted shape of the tree. The central composition works here. It may be a little bit underexposed, but nonetheless a nice photo.', '2002-12-20 09:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(175715, 9777, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lone tree in this shot isn''t interesting enough to lift the photo. It seems empty, flat and static. A closer crop of the tree might have been nicer.</td>', 'The lone tree in this shot isn''t interesting enough to lift the photo. It seems empty, flat and static. A closer crop of the tree might have been nicer.', '2002-12-20 09:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(175721, 9790, 4493, '<td valign="top">Oooh! It''s a frog! I think just a little side light to contrast the outline would help.</td>', 'Oooh! It''s a frog! I think just a little side light to contrast the outline would help.', '2002-12-20 09:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(175722, 9713, 1037, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning! I love the tight crop on this. It''s like a shaft of light. The clouds are just gorgeous. A 10 from me!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning! I love the tight crop on this. It''s like a shaft of light. The clouds are just gorgeous. A 10 from me!', '2002-12-20 09:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(175724, 9654, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and composition, but seems a bit overexposed. It would havbe been nicer to have the canopy darker so you could bring out more detail in the bark. The black and white is a bit too grey also. Not enough tonal depth.</td>', 'Nice angle and composition, but seems a bit overexposed. It would havbe been nicer to have the canopy darker so you could bring out more detail in the bark. The black and white is a bit too grey also. Not enough tonal depth.', '2002-12-20 09:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(175725, 9663, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beatuiful colours! The silhouette of the grass is very nice. There''s a great sense of scale to this photo. I can imagine it will be popular, maybe even place in the to 10. Nice work.</td>', 'Beatuiful colours! The silhouette of the grass is very nice. There''s a great sense of scale to this photo. I can imagine it will be popular, maybe even place in the to 10. Nice work.', '2002-12-20 09:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(175726, 9740, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this one! One of the best tree photos in the bunch. The filagree of trunk, branches and twigs is divine, and the steely grey/blue colour of the sky sets it off beautifully. One of my 10s.</td>', 'I love this one! One of the best tree photos in the bunch. The filagree of trunk, branches and twigs is divine, and the steely grey/blue colour of the sky sets it off beautifully. One of my 10s.', '2002-12-20 09:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(175727, 9783, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the crop, and the vivid colours. Maybe the leaves in the foreground seem a little bit underwhelming, though, in this tight rectangle. The composition is a little bit awkward.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the crop, and the vivid colours. Maybe the leaves in the foreground seem a little bit underwhelming, though, in this tight rectangle. The composition is a little bit awkward.', '2002-12-20 09:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(175728, 9819, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, the light in this scene is beautifully soft and diffuse, and you got a great glassy effect in that water. I love how the green lichen is set off by all those muted greys and browns. Gorgeous.</td>', 'Wow, the light in this scene is beautifully soft and diffuse, and you got a great glassy effect in that water. I love how the green lichen is set off by all those muted greys and browns. Gorgeous.', '2002-12-20 09:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(175729, 9791, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Another of the great tree shots in this challenge. The composition is really well done and the sun behind the clouds is a  nice effect. 10 from me.</td>', 'Very nice. Another of the great tree shots in this challenge. The composition is really well done and the sun behind the clouds is a  nice effect. 10 from me.', '2002-12-20 09:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(175730, 9774, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I actually think the colours are too dull. Black and white might have worked better. I really like the way the elk(?) is nestled among the rocks.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I actually think the colours are too dull. Black and white might have worked better. I really like the way the elk(?) is nestled among the rocks.', '2002-12-20 09:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(175732, 9696, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The twigs and branches look harsh and foreboding, set off very well by the crow. It seems low res or oversharpened though, and the colour of the sky is a bit too bright to suit the mood. Maybe taking down the saturation would have lifted this photo a bit more.</td>', 'Nice idea. The twigs and branches look harsh and foreboding, set off very well by the crow. It seems low res or oversharpened though, and the colour of the sky is a bit too bright to suit the mood. Maybe taking down the saturation would have lifted this photo a bit more.', '2002-12-20 09:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(175733, 9810, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The overexposed, contrasty rocks and vivid colours give this photo a real sense of drama. It mostly works... it just seems a tiny bit overdone. Too garish.</td>', 'Interesting. The overexposed, contrasty rocks and vivid colours give this photo a real sense of drama. It mostly works... it just seems a tiny bit overdone. Too garish.', '2002-12-20 09:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(175734, 9815, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty, dainty scene. The reflection is beautiful. There is enough tonal depth to work while maintaining an overall feeling of soft, feathery greys. A very nice photo. One of my 10s</td>', 'This is a pretty, dainty scene. The reflection is beautiful. There is enough tonal depth to work while maintaining an overall feeling of soft, feathery greys. A very nice photo. One of my 10s', '2002-12-20 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(175737, 9793, 1037, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s low res and it seems like you used the flash, but I like the composition around these two trees. It has a kind of ghostly charm that works for me! You did well with what must be some limited equipment. Worth a highish score.</td>', 'Well, it''s low res and it seems like you used the flash, but I like the composition around these two trees. It has a kind of ghostly charm that works for me! You did well with what must be some limited equipment. Worth a highish score.', '2002-12-20 10:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(175740, 9759, 1037, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but seems overexposed. There are some great textures here, but overall it seems busy, and lacks depth.</td>', 'Pretty, but seems overexposed. There are some great textures here, but overall it seems busy, and lacks depth.', '2002-12-20 10:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(175741, 9758, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s cool that this is legal, and it''s a great exploration of the challenge topic, but I don''t think it''s an attractive image.</td>', 'It''s cool that this is legal, and it''s a great exploration of the challenge topic, but I don''t think it''s an attractive image.', '2002-12-20 10:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(175742, 9630, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute girl, and nicely framed, but the lighting isn''t very good for a portrait. The soft focus on her face doesn''t really work in this photo.</td>', 'Cute girl, and nicely framed, but the lighting isn''t very good for a portrait. The soft focus on her face doesn''t really work in this photo.', '2002-12-20 10:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(175744, 9766, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. It definitely brings to mind desolation. The tones are a bit flat, but the composition is nice. I think I might have preferred a slightly tighter vertical crop though.</td>', 'Interesting scene. It definitely brings to mind desolation. The tones are a bit flat, but the composition is nice. I think I might have preferred a slightly tighter vertical crop though.', '2002-12-20 10:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(175745, 9644, 1037, '<td valign="top">The light on the antlers is too harsh. It needs to be diffused by some tissue paper or something like that. I can''t see much of the texture on the antlers at all, and there''s too much light on the background. The composition is quite nice.</td>', 'The light on the antlers is too harsh. It needs to be diffused by some tissue paper or something like that. I can''t see much of the texture on the antlers at all, and there''s too much light on the background. The composition is quite nice.', '2002-12-20 10:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(175747, 9752, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I like the duotone you used on the clouds. Another of the nicer tree silhouette photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice composition. I like the duotone you used on the clouds. Another of the nicer tree silhouette photos in this challenge.', '2002-12-20 10:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(175748, 9781, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm... the image quality is a bit low, but the composition is very effective. I''d like some more contrast, I think. Otherwise, it''s a very nice photo.</td>', 'Hmm... the image quality is a bit low, but the composition is very effective. I''d like some more contrast, I think. Otherwise, it''s a very nice photo.', '2002-12-20 10:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(175749, 9748, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very flat and grey. It would be a fairly effective shot with more contrast, and probably a tighter crop. It has a kind of subtle charm, but overall is a bit dull.</td>', 'This is very flat and grey. It would be a fairly effective shot with more contrast, and probably a tighter crop. It has a kind of subtle charm, but overall is a bit dull.', '2002-12-20 10:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(175750, 9590, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. The little splash of colour is nice. The border seems overbearing though, especially the thickness at the top and bottom.</td>', 'Interesting image. The little splash of colour is nice. The border seems overbearing though, especially the thickness at the top and bottom.', '2002-12-20 10:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(175752, 9643, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, vivid colours. These icy photos are so alien to me down here in the southern hemisphere! I like this one, nice DOF.</td>', 'Interesting composition, vivid colours. These icy photos are so alien to me down here in the southern hemisphere! I like this one, nice DOF.', '2002-12-20 10:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(175754, 9677, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this! The moon just seems dwarfed by those clouds. The colours are strong and the composition is really tight. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like this! The moon just seems dwarfed by those clouds. The colours are strong and the composition is really tight. Nice work.', '2002-12-20 10:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(175756, 9730, 1037, '<td valign="top">The blue in this is a little bit overbearing, and the strong border kind of pushes it over the top. I love the bird. It was well captured, on that lovely branch against the sky. Desaturating it a bit or converting to black and white would have been more comfortable for me, I think.</td>', 'The blue in this is a little bit overbearing, and the strong border kind of pushes it over the top. I love the bird. It was well captured, on that lovely branch against the sky. Desaturating it a bit or converting to black and white would have been more comfortable for me, I think.', '2002-12-20 10:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(175757, 9636, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I just love it. The feathery softness of those twigs is poetic. Definitely a 10.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I just love it. The feathery softness of those twigs is poetic. Definitely a 10.', '2002-12-20 10:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(175759, 9755, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... intriguing. These ice photos are weird to me, because I''ve only been in snow twice in my life. This one is particularly nice. Simple, strong composition. Good work.</td>', 'Hmmm... intriguing. These ice photos are weird to me, because I''ve only been in snow twice in my life. This one is particularly nice. Simple, strong composition. Good work.', '2002-12-20 10:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(175760, 9784, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love it! Simple and effective. Very serene. The smoothness of the sand is just gorgeous, punctuated by stones. Great tonal depth in your black and white. A 10!</td>', 'Wow! I love it! Simple and effective. Very serene. The smoothness of the sand is just gorgeous, punctuated by stones. Great tonal depth in your black and white. A 10!', '2002-12-20 10:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(175763, 9627, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... pleasant, but a bit dull. The colours are washed out on my monitor, which is calibrated to match the squares at the bottom of the voting page. Some more tonal depth would lift this, but the composition is still a bit flat.</td>', 'Hmmm.... pleasant, but a bit dull. The colours are washed out on my monitor, which is calibrated to match the squares at the bottom of the voting page. Some more tonal depth would lift this, but the composition is still a bit flat.', '2002-12-20 10:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(175764, 9821, 1037, '<td valign="top">I can see reflections off glass in this. The colours are muted, and the composition is awkward. I would have liked to see more of the mountains down there. The clouds alone aren''t spectacular enough for an interesting photo.</td>', 'I can see reflections off glass in this. The colours are muted, and the composition is awkward. I would have liked to see more of the mountains down there. The clouds alone aren''t spectacular enough for an interesting photo.', '2002-12-20 10:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(175765, 9729, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool. That''s all I can say about this. I love what you did, and can''t critique it in the slightest :). 10!</td>', 'Very cool. That''s all I can say about this. I love what you did, and can''t critique it in the slightest :). 10!', '2002-12-20 10:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(175766, 9744, 1037, '<td valign="top">Probably the nicest running water photo in this challenge (although there may be more I haven''t seen yet!). You hit exactly the right settings to get that water looking glassy and spectacular, with the rocks beautifully sharp and perfectly exposed. I think the border is a little bit too thick, but this is going to be a 10 from me.</td>', 'Probably the nicest running water photo in this challenge (although there may be more I haven''t seen yet!). You hit exactly the right settings to get that water looking glassy and spectacular, with the rocks beautifully sharp and perfectly exposed. I think the border is a little bit too thick, but this is going to be a 10 from me.', '2002-12-20 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(175769, 9824, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting... something I never see in my country. However, the colours are flat and dull... the composition is awkward. It seems underexposed.</td>', 'Interesting... something I never see in my country. However, the colours are flat and dull... the composition is awkward. It seems underexposed.', '2002-12-20 10:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(175770, 9772, 1037, '<td valign="top">Seems a little overexposed, but that purple leaf is just amazing! This photo has a great alien quality to it. I love it.</td>', 'Seems a little overexposed, but that purple leaf is just amazing! This photo has a great alien quality to it. I love it.', '2002-12-20 10:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(175771, 9700, 1037, '<td valign="top">Sharp and bright, but it seems kind of flat. If you had a shallower depth of field and cropped more tightly, this would be a more interesting photo.</td>', 'Sharp and bright, but it seems kind of flat. If you had a shallower depth of field and cropped more tightly, this would be a more interesting photo.', '2002-12-20 10:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(175772, 9761, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how this meets the challenge. The hand of man is all over Santa Claus... especially the hand of the Coca-Cola company :P. The composition is really nice and you''ve pushed all the right buttons technically, so it''s a good photo. Not very interesting to me though.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how this meets the challenge. The hand of man is all over Santa Claus... especially the hand of the Coca-Cola company :P. The composition is really nice and you''ve pushed all the right buttons technically, so it''s a good photo. Not very interesting to me though.', '2002-12-20 10:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(175773, 9790, 1037, '<td valign="top">HMM... there isn\''t a lot going on in this photo. The textures are interesting, but the colours are flat and dull. With a bit more contrast, and some experiments with different exposures, I think you could have achieved something interesting, but this doesn\''t really get there.<br/> <br/>Updated - I didn''t see the frog until I looked at the thumbnail after I finished voting, and it suddenly appeared! I don''t  think it''ll change my vote though, because the flaws I saw initially still stand.</td>', 'HMM... there isn\''t a lot going on in this photo. The textures are interesting, but the colours are flat and dull. With a bit more contrast, and some experiments with different exposures, I think you could have achieved something interesting, but this doesn\''t really get there. Updated - I didn''t see the frog until I looked at the thumbnail after I finished voting, and it suddenly appeared! I don''t  think it''ll change my vote though, because the flaws I saw initially still stand.', '2002-12-20 10:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(175810, 9677, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  good title.  i love the clouds and how they open up just around the moon.  good photo.  i think the frame does not work well with this shot ... it''s the only white thing and makes the clouds look even more yellow than they are.  but that may just be my personal taste.</td>', 'challenge met.  good title.  i love the clouds and how they open up just around the moon.  good photo.  i think the frame does not work well with this shot ... it''s the only white thing and makes the clouds look even more yellow than they are.  but that may just be my personal taste.', '2002-12-20 13:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(175811, 9636, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  nice angle.  also works well in a monochrome.</td>', 'challenge met.  nice angle.  also works well in a monochrome.', '2002-12-20 13:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(175815, 9590, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  interesting idea.  i like all the different snow/ice chips and then just the frozen leaf.  you got a very good color for your snow/ice, white, but not blown out.  personally, i would''ve cropped this as a landscape around the leaf to give it more prominence in the photo.  i also don''t really like your frame, there''s nothing black in the photo, so the black frame is a little stark in my opinion.  it also seems to be wider at the top and bottom, which i find distracting (unless it''s wider at the bottom and you have text in it, i do that a lot).   for the challenges here, even width all around works better IMO.</td>', 'challenge met.  interesting idea.  i like all the different snow/ice chips and then just the frozen leaf.  you got a very good color for your snow/ice, white, but not blown out.  personally, i would''ve cropped this as a landscape around the leaf to give it more prominence in the photo.  i also don''t really like your frame, there''s nothing black in the photo, so the black frame is a little stark in my opinion.  it also seems to be wider at the top and bottom, which i find distracting (unless it''s wider at the bottom and you have text in it, i do that a lot).   for the challenges here, even width all around works better IMO.', '2002-12-20 13:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(175816, 9758, 1041, '<td valign="top">cool effect.  i saw the discussions in the forums and didn''t think this was going to be accepted as legal.  glad to see that it is ... i''m jealous of the feature  :)  nice way of using it for the challenge, too.  i wonder what the overall result of your shot is ... if people will accept this in-camera function.  i hope they will.  good luck  :)</td>', 'cool effect.  i saw the discussions in the forums and didn''t think this was going to be accepted as legal.  glad to see that it is ... i''m jealous of the feature  :)  nice way of using it for the challenge, too.  i wonder what the overall result of your shot is ... if people will accept this in-camera function.  i hope they will.  good luck  :)', '2002-12-20 13:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(175818, 9752, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i like how you balance the tree and the clouds as subjects in the photo.  i would like to see more of the bottom of the tree, but i suspect the "hand of man" would show itself in some way, shape, or form.  i also like the color you have chosen for this photo, it works very well.  while the frame matches that color well, i personally don''t like it so much.  i think a black frame would''ve worked better here (since you can only use one frame).  with multiple frames, maybe just add a thin black line and then test out this frame again.  but then, that''s just personal taste, anyway.</td>', 'challenge met.  i like how you balance the tree and the clouds as subjects in the photo.  i would like to see more of the bottom of the tree, but i suspect the "hand of man" would show itself in some way, shape, or form.  i also like the color you have chosen for this photo, it works very well.  while the frame matches that color well, i personally don''t like it so much.  i think a black frame would''ve worked better here (since you can only use one frame).  with multiple frames, maybe just add a thin black line and then test out this frame again.  but then, that''s just personal taste, anyway.', '2002-12-20 13:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(175823, 9661, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge not met ... in my opinion (and i know that that''s likely not the same as yours, as you obviously think your photo matches the challenge, but i have to vote according to my own interpretation, sorry.  that out of the way, i did want to give you my comments on your photo anyway, because i think it is a really nice shot.  i''ve tried things with food coloring but haven''t had such nice results.  i think you managed to get them just streaky and mixed enough without them all getting mixed into one.  you can see all sorts of shapes and figures in it when you look at it long enough  :)  the black frame works well (so does the title for that matter), but i think i would make the frame a little thinner.  was there any way of making the background more evenly white?  it''s great on the right, not quite as good on the left (this is nitpicky, btw).  anyway.  i like the shot  :)</td>', 'challenge not met ... in my opinion (and i know that that''s likely not the same as yours, as you obviously think your photo matches the challenge, but i have to vote according to my own interpretation, sorry.  that out of the way, i did want to give you my comments on your photo anyway, because i think it is a really nice shot.  i''ve tried things with food coloring but haven''t had such nice results.  i think you managed to get them just streaky and mixed enough without them all getting mixed into one.  you can see all sorts of shapes and figures in it when you look at it long enough  :)  the black frame works well (so does the title for that matter), but i think i would make the frame a little thinner.  was there any way of making the background more evenly white?  it''s great on the right, not quite as good on the left (this is nitpicky, btw).  anyway.  i like the shot  :)', '2002-12-20 13:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(175824, 9644, 1041, '<td valign="top">awesome photo, but this looks very much like it was set up inside, and therefore does not meet my definition of the challenge (which, i know, is different from yours since you consider this to meet the challenge, but i have to vote according to my definition).  sorry.  anyway, that out of the way, i did want to give you feedback on the photo.  i think it''s totally cool how your have arranged the antlers and how old and weathered they look.  they really could tell stories, i''m sure. very nicely lit, and great black background.  just the right amount of space around without looking too empty.  in a different competition you would get very high marks from me.  :)</td>', 'awesome photo, but this looks very much like it was set up inside, and therefore does not meet my definition of the challenge (which, i know, is different from yours since you consider this to meet the challenge, but i have to vote according to my definition).  sorry.  anyway, that out of the way, i did want to give you feedback on the photo.  i think it''s totally cool how your have arranged the antlers and how old and weathered they look.  they really could tell stories, i''m sure. very nicely lit, and great black background.  just the right amount of space around without looking too empty.  in a different competition you would get very high marks from me.  :)', '2002-12-20 13:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(175825, 9663, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  definitely one of my favorites so far in this challenge (edit: this ended up in my top 3).  i love the whole idea of the grass and sunset which, even though your title indicates prarie, always reminds me of the beach.  it''s nice that the sky is mainly blue, and just has those fiery colors at the bottom, just above the horizon.  the square format works well.  now that frames are permitted, i think a slight black frame would have worked well, too.  but who knows.  good job in any case.  :)</td>', 'challenge met.  definitely one of my favorites so far in this challenge (edit: this ended up in my top 3).  i love the whole idea of the grass and sunset which, even though your title indicates prarie, always reminds me of the beach.  it''s nice that the sky is mainly blue, and just has those fiery colors at the bottom, just above the horizon.  the square format works well.  now that frames are permitted, i think a slight black frame would have worked well, too.  but who knows.  good job in any case.  :)', '2002-12-20 14:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(175852, 9783, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  my first reaction was "WOW, what colors!".  i love the panorama crop here adn the stuff in the background that''s totally unrecognizable adds to this photo.  it reminds me of light reflecting on whater.  that may very well not be it though.  my top 3 this week.  :)</td>', 'challenge met.  my first reaction was "WOW, what colors!".  i love the panorama crop here adn the stuff in the background that''s totally unrecognizable adds to this photo.  it reminds me of light reflecting on whater.  that may very well not be it though.  my top 3 this week.  :)', '2002-12-20 16:11:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(175853, 9744, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  beautiful contrast between the flowing water and the still and sharply focused rocks.  nice contrast in tones, too.  the water has a nice flow through the photo, and the frame works well, too.  i wouldn''t change a thing.  my top 3 this week! :)</td>', 'challenge met.  beautiful contrast between the flowing water and the still and sharply focused rocks.  nice contrast in tones, too.  the water has a nice flow through the photo, and the frame works well, too.  i wouldn''t change a thing.  my top 3 this week! :)', '2002-12-20 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(175854, 9713, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i like the format and the color here a lot.  the title also adds a nice "angle" to this.  makes me feel like floating above the clouds, but not too high because the sun is breaking through right at the top of the photo.  made it into my top 6 this week.  :)</td>', 'challenge met.  i like the format and the color here a lot.  the title also adds a nice "angle" to this.  makes me feel like floating above the clouds, but not too high because the sun is breaking through right at the top of the photo.  made it into my top 6 this week.  :)', '2002-12-20 16:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(175915, 9730, 1856, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition...I''m quite impressed :)  Did you blue this up a bit..seems a little too blue for me on the bird.  I originally thought this was an egret-like bird..but it''s a duck, isn''t it? How funny!  Okay...on third look...i see an egret-like bird again...what is this??!! LOL</td>', 'Perfect composition...I''m quite impressed :)  Did you blue this up a bit..seems a little too blue for me on the bird.  I originally thought this was an egret-like bird..but it''s a duck, isn''t it? How funny!  Okay...on third look...i see an egret-like bird again...what is this??!! LOL', '2002-12-20 22:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(175927, 9729, 811, '<td valign="top">Wow, an admin note.  I am sooooo impressed!  You could have called it "Eat more chik''n" and sold it to chick-fil-a for an advertisement!!!  Hahahhahahh (I crack myself up!) :-)</td>', 'Wow, an admin note.  I am sooooo impressed!  You could have called it "Eat more chik''n" and sold it to chick-fil-a for an advertisement!!!  Hahahhahahh (I crack myself up!) :-)', '2002-12-20 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(175942, 9821, 3080, '<td valign="top">I know this is getting picky, but what are the lines going through the clouds?  This looks like it was taken though a window. Is it reflection of the lighting inside?  Whatever it is, it''s kind of distracting from the overall "untouched by man" theme.  If not for them, I think this would be an excelent example of the challenge.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and the clouds are really nice as well.  the color is a bit dull, and it need some contrast, but it''s still a pretty shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I know this is getting picky, but what are the lines going through the clouds?  This looks like it was taken though a window. Is it reflection of the lighting inside?  Whatever it is, it''s kind of distracting from the overall "untouched by man" theme.  If not for them, I think this would be an excelent example of the challenge.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and the clouds are really nice as well.  the color is a bit dull, and it need some contrast, but it''s still a pretty shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-21 00:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(175945, 9644, 3080, '<td valign="top">The black background appears to be "human intervention".  I could be wrong about that, but it doesn''t look naturally occuring.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice, and I really like the lighting on the antlers.  They look very old.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The black background appears to be "human intervention".  I could be wrong about that, but it doesn''t look naturally occuring.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice, and I really like the lighting on the antlers.  They look very old.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-21 00:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(175947, 9721, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  I really like how the fallen petals are sitting down there on the leaf.  you can see them, but they aren''t distracting from the main focal point.  the colors are great, and lighting is very nice as well.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice focus.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  I really like how the fallen petals are sitting down there on the leaf.  you can see them, but they aren''t distracting from the main focal point.  the colors are great, and lighting is very nice as well.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-21 00:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(175949, 9722, 3080, '<td valign="top">definately looks untouched by man.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice, and the lighting looks to be good as well.  The focus looks a bit soft to me, but that could just be a result of all the wetness.  Overall a nice shot for the challenge. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'definately looks untouched by man.  The angle and framing/cropping is nice, and the lighting looks to be good as well.  The focus looks a bit soft to me, but that could just be a result of all the wetness.  Overall a nice shot for the challenge. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-21 01:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(175950, 9676, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''m not quite sure what it is, but it looks untouched by man.  Uless it''s from a nuclear power plant run off, and then I''d have to wonder, but looks good to me.  Focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good too.  I like the foggy look.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting.  I''m not quite sure what it is, but it looks untouched by man.  Uless it''s from a nuclear power plant run off, and then I''d have to wonder, but looks good to me.  Focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good too.  I like the foggy look.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-21 01:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(175966, 9636, 2011, '<td valign="top">This is the shot that I wanted to do, but I couldnt pull it off.  Nice work. Nice composition. Love the sepia. 10 boyte1</td>', 'This is the shot that I wanted to do, but I couldnt pull it off.  Nice work. Nice composition. Love the sepia. 10 boyte1', '2002-12-21 07:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(175967, 9636, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo.  I really like the way you have all trees coming in from all sides with the middle wide open.</td>', 'I think this is a great photo.  I really like the way you have all trees coming in from all sides with the middle wide open.', '2002-12-21 07:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(176011, 9757, 2217, '<td valign="top">Striking picture, nicely captured.  Colours are vibrant and the compostition good.</td>', 'Striking picture, nicely captured.  Colours are vibrant and the compostition good.', '2002-12-21 14:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
