(176018, 9793, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what happened here.. the image quality is fairly poor.  The ''without the hand of man'' concept in this shot may have been damaged by the camera flash... - setzler</td>', 'I''m not sure what happened here.. the image quality is fairly poor.  The ''without the hand of man'' concept in this shot may have been damaged by the camera flash... - setzler', '2002-12-21 14:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
