(176493, 9714, 4085, '<td valign="top">For all those comments for improvment, thank you.<br/> <br/>This image was taken on a overcast and rainy day (surprise, surprise around Seattle), without a tripod (mistake), with a flash (BIG MISTAKE).  The flash caused a few of the raindrops to reflect as phantom light streaks in part of the photo.<br/> <br/>I will definitely go back to Deception Falls on a brighter, less rainy day to get a much better picture. :-)<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'For all those comments for improvment, thank you. This image was taken on a overcast and rainy day (surprise, surprise around Seattle), without a tripod (mistake), with a flash (BIG MISTAKE).  The flash caused a few of the raindrops to reflect as phantom light streaks in part of the photo. I will definitely go back to Deception Falls on a brighter, less rainy day to get a much better picture. :-) Thanks again.', '2002-12-23 00:14:07.000000', NULL, 0),
