(176950, 9663, 714, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the vote and kind comments.  I really didn''t think I would get 1st place.  This is a great feeling!  It''s funny because I was lucking to even get this shot.  I was in the kitchen and noticed the beautiful oranges, pinks, purples and blues in the sky and thought this is the perfect sunset for the challenge.  I got 3 of the 4 kids in the van and off we went.  I wanted to get far enough out of town, so I couldn''t see any roads or telephone wires.  It seemed like everyone in front of me was purposely going slow or for once in their lives going the speed limit.  The sun was creeping down fast.  I finally got there and got the shot. I walked away smelling like a sage brush, but was happy. I wish I could have got more of the orange colors, but I am glad everyone liked this shot.  Thanks again<br/>Sonja</td>', 'Thank you all for the vote and kind comments.  I really didn''t think I would get 1st place.  This is a great feeling!  It''s funny because I was lucking to even get this shot.  I was in the kitchen and noticed the beautiful oranges, pinks, purples and blues in the sky and thought this is the perfect sunset for the challenge.  I got 3 of the 4 kids in the van and off we went.  I wanted to get far enough out of town, so I couldn''t see any roads or telephone wires.  It seemed like everyone in front of me was purposely going slow or for once in their lives going the speed limit.  The sun was creeping down fast.  I finally got there and got the shot. I walked away smelling like a sage brush, but was happy. I wish I could have got more of the orange colors, but I am glad everyone liked this shot.  Thanks againSonja', '2002-12-23 12:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(176954, 9744, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good job, girl!  I''m so proud of you, and I will never forget watching you take this shot :-)  Great work!</td>', 'Good job, girl!  I''m so proud of you, and I will never forget watching you take this shot :-)  Great work!', '2002-12-23 12:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
