(177415, 9783, 2003, '<td valign="top">For this challenge, i walked down to the river on sunday evening and this is the only shot i took.  The leaves are from the trees that line the bike trail, the darkness at the bottom are the trees on the far side of the river, and the sunset/clouds are at about 5 minutes past sundown.  Very nice of the rain to hold off until we had this display.</td>', 'For this challenge, i walked down to the river on sunday evening and this is the only shot i took.  The leaves are from the trees that line the bike trail, the darkness at the bottom are the trees on the far side of the river, and the sunset/clouds are at about 5 minutes past sundown.  Very nice of the rain to hold off until we had this display.', '2002-12-24 00:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(177750, 9774, 2337, '<td valign="top">To those that asked... This is an endangered African plains deer.  I don''t know it''s name, but she currently lives at the Wild Animal Park (a subsidiary of the San Diego Zoo)... I took this from a tram ride that goes around the enclosure the animals share.</td>', 'To those that asked... This is an endangered African plains deer.  I don''t know it''s name, but she currently lives at the Wild Animal Park (a subsidiary of the San Diego Zoo)... I took this from a tram ride that goes around the enclosure the animals share.', '2002-12-24 15:51:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(177833, 9713, 4967, '<td valign="top">Talya''s Critique (critique club on break)<br/>This is a really beautiful and striking photo.  I really like it!  <br/>Composition - beautiful, it wouldn''t be half as good if you didn''t have the extra layer of clouds at the very top.  I might have cropped a little more off the bottom as it seems to lose some of the detail that the rest of the photo has.  <br/> <br/>Lighting - really superb, I love the colors that the light allows here.  The extra bright spot at the very top is slightly annoying but not terrible.  <br/> <br/>Focus - excellent the overall clarity is really nice.<br/> <br/>Exposure - great job with this!<br/> <br/>Fit the challenge - really well, it''s obvious there is no hand of man, and it''s beautiful also.  Definitely the best cloud picture of the challenge!<br/> <br/>Overall - I gave this a 9.  I thought it was really lovely!  Nice job.</td>', 'Talya''s Critique (critique club on break)This is a really beautiful and striking photo.  I really like it!  Composition - beautiful, it wouldn''t be half as good if you didn''t have the extra layer of clouds at the very top.  I might have cropped a little more off the bottom as it seems to lose some of the detail that the rest of the photo has.   Lighting - really superb, I love the colors that the light allows here.  The extra bright spot at the very top is slightly annoying but not terrible.   Focus - excellent the overall clarity is really nice. Exposure - great job with this! Fit the challenge - really well, it''s obvious there is no hand of man, and it''s beautiful also.  Definitely the best cloud picture of the challenge! Overall - I gave this a 9.  I thought it was really lovely!  Nice job.', '2002-12-24 18:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
