(179069, 9713, 1031, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your wonderful comments!<br/> <br/>I found it very amusing that, while the voting was going on, there was a forum thread regarding "saving" a photo by "funny" cropping. I <b><i>so</i></b> much wanted to use this image as an example...I don''t think anyone has mentioned recognizing what otherwise might have been a pretty ordinary urban sunset photo...<br/> <br/>For the curious, here is a link to the <a href="//www.pbase.com/image/9220644/medium" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">original frame</a> from which I extracted my entry. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.pbase.com/image/9220644/small.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.pbase.com/image/9220644/small.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.pbase.com/image/9220644/small.jpg"/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks everyone for your wonderful comments! I found it very amusing that, while the voting was going on, there was a forum thread regarding "saving" a photo by "funny" cropping. I so much wanted to use this image as an example...I don''t think anyone has mentioned recognizing what otherwise might have been a pretty ordinary urban sunset photo... For the curious, here is a link to the original frame from which I extracted my entry.  ', '2002-12-29 01:58:56.000000', NULL, 0),
